(window.PL_LANG_Q = window.PL_LANG_Q || []).push([{"Cindy":"辛迪","...You again. I heard you ran Team Rocket out of the well.":"……又是你。听说你把火箭队赶出了井里。","Those Rocket clowns only act tough in a crowd. I cannot stand people like that.":"火箭队那帮小丑只敢成群结队地逞强。我最受不了那种人。","But I didn't come for them. I came to beat you!":"不过我不是为他们来的。我是来打败你的！","...Tch. My Pokémon were too weak. I'll get stronger ones, whatever it takes.":"……啧。是我的宝可梦太弱了。不管用什么办法，我都要弄到更强的。","Bug Pokémon are full of surprises. I am going to keep studying them, and one day I will know them all!":"虫宝可梦充满了惊喜。我会继续研究它们，总有一天我会了解所有的虫宝可梦！","Hm? A Trainer? I am Kurt. I make Poké Balls out of Apricorns.":"嗯？是训练家吗？我是钢铁，用球果制作精灵球的。","But there is no time for that now! Team Rocket is back, and they are cutting off the Slowpoke's tails in the well to sell them!":"不过现在没空管那个了！火箭队又回来了，他们在井里割呆呆兽的尾巴拿去卖！","I will not stand for it. I am going down there to teach them a lesson myself!":"我绝不允许！我要亲自下去教训他们！","Ouch... I jumped down the ladder and hurt my back. I can barely move!":"哎哟……我从梯子上跳下来，把腰扭到了。几乎动不了了！","Please, drive Team Rocket out for me. The Slowpoke are counting on you!":"拜托你，替我把火箭队赶走吧。呆呆兽们就靠你了！","Fine! We are pulling out. We cut enough tails already, anyway.":"好吧！我们撤。反正尾巴也割得够多了。","{player}! You did it! The Slowpoke are safe. Let us get out of here. Come and see me at my house.":"{player}！你做到了！呆呆兽们得救了。我们出去吧。来我家找我。","You chased Team Rocket out of the well. The Slowpoke are safe, thanks to you!":"你把火箭队赶出了井里。多亏了你，呆呆兽们平安无事！","My back still hurts, though... Oh, and Bugsy is back at his Gym. He came running when he heard the news.":"不过我的腰还是好痛……对了，阿笔回到他的道馆了。他一听到消息就跑回来了。","The Gym's door is locked. A note on it reads: \"Out looking for rare bugs. Back soon! Bugsy\"":"道馆的门锁着。门上贴着一张纸条：“出门找稀有的虫子去了。马上回来！阿笔”","Yo, Champion! Bugsy uses Bug-type Pokémon. Fire and Flying moves will do the trick.":"哟，冠军！阿笔用的是虫属性的宝可梦。火属性和飞行属性的招式很管用。","With one Johto badge, Pokémon up to level 25 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 30!":"有一枚城都徽章，25级以下的宝可梦会听你的。在这里赢了，就能提高到30级！","Okay, you win. This is yours: the Hive Badge.":"好吧，你赢了。这个给你：昆虫徽章。","{player} received the Hive Badge from Bugsy!":"{player}从阿笔那里得到了昆虫徽章！","With the Hive Badge, Pokémon up to level 30 will listen to you.":"有了昆虫徽章，30级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话。","Take this too: TM17, Protect. Bug Pokémon survive by hiding in their shells. With Protect, any Pokémon can do the same for a turn.":"这个也给你：招式学习器17，守住。虫宝可梦会躲进壳里求生。用了守住，任何宝可梦都能在一回合里做到同样的事。","This well is closed. Team business. ...What? No, we are definitely not doing anything to the Slowpoke. Move along!":"这口井封闭了。组织的事。……什么？没有，我们绝对没对呆呆兽做什么。走开走开！","The Slowpoke have all vanished from town... I saw strange people in black near the well.":"镇上的呆呆兽全都不见了……我看到井边有一些穿黑衣服的怪人。","The Slowpoke are back! When they yawn, rain is sure to follow.":"呆呆兽们回来了！它们一打哈欠，就一定会下雨。","Kurt makes Poké Balls out of Apricorns. People come from all over Johto to see him!":"钢铁用球果制作精灵球。城都各地的人都会来找他！","The Gym Leader, Bugsy, knows everything about Bug Pokémon. And he is barely older than me!":"道馆馆主阿笔对虫宝可梦无所不知。而且他只比我大一点点！","A Slowpoke, yawning in the sun. It is glad to be home.":"一只在晒太阳打哈欠的呆呆兽。它很高兴能回家。","A Slowpoke. It stares at nothing in particular.":"一只呆呆兽。它正呆呆地望着前方。","Have you met Kurt? His Poké Balls are famous, but these days he is busy with the Slowpoke trouble.":"你见过钢铁吗？他做的精灵球很有名，不过最近他在为呆呆兽的事烦心。","Union Cave is full of Zubat. Repels sell well in this town!":"互连洞里全是超音蝠。所以除虫喷雾在这个镇上很好卖！","Grandpa ran off to the well... I hope he is all right.":"爷爷跑去井那边了……希望他没事。","A Slowpoke's tail grows back, Grandpa says. But it must still hurt. Thank you for saving them!":"爷爷说呆呆兽的尾巴还会再长出来。但一定还是很痛吧。谢谢你救了它们！","A Slowpoke. Its tail has been cut short, but it only yawns.":"一只呆呆兽。它的尾巴被割短了，可它只是打了个哈欠。","A Slowpoke, dozing. It does not seem to know anything is wrong.":"一只在打瞌睡的呆呆兽。它好像完全不知道出了什么事。","Who let a kid down here? Get lost!":"谁让小鬼下来的？滚开！","Ugh... I lost.":"呃……我输了。","Slowpoke tails are a delicacy, you know. They sell for a fortune!":"呆呆兽的尾巴可是美味佳肴，能卖大价钱呢！","We are busy here. Do not make me deal with you!":"我们正忙着呢。别逼我收拾你！","I got dealt with...":"结果是我被收拾了……","Team Rocket is back! Did you not hear?":"火箭队回来了！你没听说吗？","Those Slowpoke do not even notice when we cut their tails. So why should you care?":"那些呆呆兽被割尾巴都没感觉。你凭什么多管闲事？","Okay, okay. You care a lot.":"好吧好吧，看来你很在乎。","The one in charge is at the back. He will deal with you.":"负责的人在最里面。他会收拾你的。","So you made it all the way down here. I am in charge of this job, and you are not ruining it!":"你居然一路走到这里来了。这次的任务由我负责，你别想坏我的事！","Unbelievable... a kid beat me.":"难以置信……居然被小鬼打败了。","Benny":"小本","Bugs evolve fast, and so do I! Battle!":"虫子进化得快，我也一样！来对战！","My bugs needed more time...":"我的虫子还需要更多时间……","Bugsy studies how Bug Pokémon grow. He is a real scientist!":"阿笔在研究虫宝可梦是怎么成长的。他是个真正的科学家！","You cannot reach Bugsy without getting past me!":"不打败我，你就别想见到阿笔！","Squashed...":"被压扁了……","Fire moves are tough on bugs. That is no secret.":"火属性的招式对虫子很有效。这可不是什么秘密。","Paras grow mushrooms on their backs. Cool, right? Battle!":"派拉斯背上会长蘑菇。很酷吧？来对战！","My mushrooms wilted...":"我的蘑菇蔫了……","Bugsy's Scyther is fast and sharp. Watch out!":"阿笔的飞天螳螂又快又锋利。小心点！","I am Bugsy! I may be young, but nobody has studied Bug Pokémon more than me. Let me show you what I have learned!":"我是阿笔！我虽然年纪小，但论研究虫宝可梦，谁也比不过我。让你看看我学到的东西吧！","Whoa, amazing! You really know your Pokémon.":"哇，太厉害了！你真的很了解你的宝可梦。","Azalea Town. A sleepy old town that loves its Slowpoke.":"桧皮镇。一个深爱着呆呆兽、慢悠悠的古老小镇。","Azalea Town Pokémon Gym. Leader: Bugsy, a young expert on all things Bug-type!":"桧皮镇宝可梦道馆。馆主：阿笔，精通一切虫属性知识的少年专家！","Slowpoke Well. Long ago, they say, the yawn of a Slowpoke ended a terrible drought here.":"呆呆兽之井。据说很久以前，一只呆呆兽打了个哈欠，就结束了这里的大旱灾。","West: Ilex Forest. Fallen trees block the path for now.":"西：栎树林。道路暂时被倒下的树挡住了。","Apricorns of every colour, sorted by size.":"各种颜色的球果，按大小排得整整齐齐。","Tools for making Poké Balls by hand.":"手工制作精灵球的工具。","I make charcoal in the kiln out back. My apprentice took our Farfetch'd to Ilex Forest to cut wood. He should be back by now...":"我在屋后的窑里烧炭。我的徒弟带着我们的大葱鸭去栎树林砍柴了。他早该回来了啊……","Our Farfetch'd cuts the wood for the kiln with its leek. Without it, there would be no charcoal. Thank you again!":"我们的大葱鸭用它的葱帮窑砍柴。没有它，就烧不出炭来。再次谢谢你！","I will never let go of Farfetch'd again. Well... I will try.":"我再也不会让大葱鸭离开我身边了。嗯……我会努力的。","Farfetch'd waves its leek proudly.":"大葱鸭得意地挥舞着它的葱。","Suicune stands before you, as calm as clear water.":"水君站在你面前，如清水般平静。","Suicune is still there, waiting for you.":"水君还在那里等着你。","So Suicune chose you... I am a little jealous. But I saw it up close, and that is enough for me.":"原来水君选择了你……我有点羡慕。不过我能近距离看到它，这就够了。","Listen! Roars from the west, from the Burned Tower. The bell has called Raikou and Entei back too!":"听！西边的烧焦塔传来了吼声。钟声把雷公和炎帝也召唤回来了！","{player}! You have the Clear Bell too? Then look, over there!":"{player}！你也有透明铃铛？那你快看那边！","Suicune... It came here, as if the bell had called it. And it is looking at you, not at me.":"水君……它来到了这里，就像被钟声召唤来的一样。而且它看着的是你，不是我。","Go on. I have chased it for ten years; the least I can do now is watch.":"去吧。我追了它十年，现在至少能在一旁看着。","Suicune is waiting for you. Go on, I will watch from here.":"水君在等你。去吧，我在这里看着。","Raikou and Entei went back to the Burned Tower, where they were reborn. They are waiting too.":"雷公和炎帝回到了它们重生的烧焦塔。它们也在等你。","All three have answered. Now climb! I have a feeling the rainbow Pokémon is close.":"三只都回应了。快上去吧！我感觉彩虹色的宝可梦就在附近。","Ho-Oh, Suicune, Raikou, Entei... I will remember this tower for the rest of my life.":"凤王、水君、雷公、炎帝……这座塔我一辈子都不会忘记。","The Clear Bell rings by itself, high and clear...":"透明铃铛自己响了起来，清脆而嘹亮……","A great rainbow-coloured Pokémon comes down onto the top of the tower!":"一只巨大的彩虹色宝可梦降落在塔顶！","Ho-Oh is still there, its wings shining like a rainbow.":"凤王还在那里，翅膀像彩虹一样闪耀。","A rainbow spreads over Ecruteak City. The legend of the two towers has come full circle.":"一道彩虹横跨圆朱市上空。两座塔的传说终于画上了圆满的句号。","A Sage stands by the stairs: Three Pokémon must answer the bell before anyone may climb.":"一位贤者守在楼梯旁：三只宝可梦回应了钟声之后，才能让人上去。","Three Pokémon were reborn in the fire of the Burned Tower. Until all three answer the bell, the stairs stay closed.":"三只宝可梦在烧焦塔的大火中重生。在它们三个都回应钟声之前，楼梯不会开放。","All three have answered the bell. The stairs are open: climb, and the rainbow Pokémon will judge you at the top.":"三只都回应了钟声。楼梯已经开放：上去吧，彩虹色的宝可梦会在塔顶考验你。","Gaku":"阿岳","The tower tests everyone who climbs it. I am the first test!":"这座塔会考验每个攀登的人。我就是第一道考验！","You may pass...":"你可以过去了……","Every floor of this tower is built without a single nail. Our ancestors were wise.":"这座塔的每一层都没用一根钉子。我们的祖先真是有智慧。","Masa":"阿正","Spirits drift through this tower at night. Mine will drift through you!":"夜里会有幽灵在这座塔里飘荡。我的幽灵会穿过你！","My spirits have scattered...":"我的幽灵都散了……","Two stairs lead up from here. Only one of them takes you higher.":"这里有两道楼梯往上走。只有一道能让你继续往上。","Koji":"浩二","Bellsprout sway like the tower in the wind. Bend, but never break!":"喇叭芽就像风中的塔一样摇摆。能弯，但绝不会断！","I bent... and broke.":"我弯了……然后断了。","The tower sways a little in strong winds. That is why it has never fallen.":"强风吹来时塔会稍稍摇晃。正因如此，它从来没有倒过。","Sohei":"宗平","My Xatu sees the past and the future. In both, I see myself winning!":"我的天然鸟能看见过去和未来。两边都是我赢！","I saw it wrong...":"我看错了……","The top is just above. Be still, and the rainbow Pokémon may come to you.":"塔顶就在上面。静下心来，彩虹色的宝可梦也许会来到你身边。","The elder of Ecruteak must hear about this. Go and tell him what you saw!":"得让圆朱市的长老知道这件事。快去告诉他你看到了什么！","...You. So you made it to Blackthorn too.":"……是你。原来你也到烟墨市了。","Lance trained in this cave. I came to see what made him so strong. All I found was an old man asking questions.":"阿渡曾在这个洞穴里修行。我来看看是什么让他变得那么强。结果只碰到一个爱问问题的老头。","He told me to come back when I understand my Pokémon. They battle, I win. What else is there to understand?":"他叫我等理解了自己的宝可梦再来。它们战斗，我赢。还有什么好理解的？","...Forget it. Stay out of my way.":"……算了。别挡我的路。","Your Pokémon fainted after a hard battle. What do you do first?":"你的宝可梦在一场苦战后倒下了。你会先做什么？","Rush it to a Pokémon Center":"赶紧带它去宝可梦中心","Send out the next one":"派出下一只","Scold it for losing":"骂它输了","A Pokémon you just caught will not listen to you. What do you do?":"刚抓到的宝可梦不听你的话。你会怎么做？","Train it until it obeys":"训练到它听话为止","Spend time with it until it trusts me":"多陪陪它，直到它信任我","Let it go":"放走它","What makes a Trainer truly strong?":"什么才能让训练家真正变强？","Never losing":"从不输","Growing together with their Pokémon":"和宝可梦一起成长","Is a weak Pokémon worth raising?":"弱小的宝可梦值得培养吗？","Every Pokémon can grow strong":"每只宝可梦都能变强","No, only the strong ones matter":"不，只有强的才重要","Only if it evolves":"除非它会进化","Hmm... I see.":"嗯……原来如此。","May the dragons watch over you on the road to the Pokémon League.":"愿龙在你前往宝可梦联盟的路上守护你。","Welcome to the Dragon Shrine. The dragon clan has trained here for generations.":"欢迎来到龙之祠。龙之一族世世代代都在这里修行。","The shrine's test is only for those Clair sends to me. Go and face her first.":"只有小椿派来的人才能接受祠堂的考验。你先去挑战她吧。","Ah, a Trainer Clair sent. She sends me everyone who beats her. She never could admit a defeat.":"啊，是小椿派来的训练家。打败她的人，她都会送到我这里来。她从来都不肯认输。","I will ask you a few questions. There is no trick to them: answer as you truly feel.":"我要问你几个问题。没有陷阱：照你的真心回答就好。","Every answer came from the heart. Your Pokémon are lucky to have you.":"每个回答都发自内心。你的宝可梦能遇到你真是幸运。","Some of your answers surprised me. But I can see that your Pokémon trust you, and that is what matters most.":"有几个回答让我有些意外。不过我看得出你的宝可梦信任你，这才是最重要的。","Clair! Come in. This Trainer has passed.":"小椿！进来吧。这位训练家通过了。","...So the Elder approves of you. Fine. I keep my word.":"……既然长老认可了你。好吧，我说话算话。","I was wrong to keep the badge from you. Here: the Rising Badge.":"是我不该扣着徽章不给你。拿去吧：升龙徽章。","{player} received the Rising Badge from Clair!":"{player}从小椿那里得到了升龙徽章！","With the Rising Badge, Pokémon of every level will obey you.":"有了升龙徽章，任何等级的宝可梦都会听你的话。","And take this: TM02, Dragon Claw. It slashes with claws as sharp as a dragon's.":"还有这个：招式学习器02，龙爪。用像龙一样锋利的爪子撕裂对手。","With eight badges you may enter the Pokémon League. Surf east from New Bark Town along Route 27, and Victory Road will lead you there.":"集齐八枚徽章就能进入宝可梦联盟。从若叶镇沿27号道路往东冲浪，冠军之路会带你到那里。","Next time we battle, I will not lose. Remember that!":"下次对战，我不会再输了。给我记住！","Before you go, take this Dratini. It hatched here at the shrine, and it should see the world with a Trainer like you.":"走之前，把这只迷你龙带上吧。它是在祠堂里出生的，应该跟着你这样的训练家去看看世界。","It knows {move}, a move no Dratini learns by itself. A gift for one who answered so well.":"它会{move}，这是迷你龙自己学不会的招式。送给回答得这么好的你。","I am the Move Deleter. I can make a Pokémon forget a move, even one from an HM. Shall I?":"我是招式遗忘者。我能让宝可梦忘掉招式，就算是秘传学习器的招式也行。要试试吗？","Come again if you need me.":"需要的话随时再来。","Forget a move: which Pokémon?":"忘记招式：哪只宝可梦？","{mon} knows only one move. I cannot take it away.":"{mon}只会一个招式。这个我可不能让它忘掉。","Which move should it forget?":"要忘掉哪个招式？","Make {mon} forget {move}?":"要让{mon}忘掉{move}吗？","Done! {mon} forgot {move}.":"好了！{mon}忘掉了{move}。","Yo, Champion! The last Johto Gym! Clair uses Dragon types. Ice and Dragon moves hit them hard.":"嗨，未来的冠军！这是城都最后一座道馆！小椿使用龙属性。冰属性和龙属性的招式对它们很有效。","See the chasms? Push the boulders into the holes with Strength and walk across. Fall, and you start over from here!":"看到那些深渊了吗？用怪力把石头推进洞里，就能走过去。掉下去的话就得从这里重来！","With seven Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 70 obey you. Win here, and they all will!":"有七枚城都徽章，70级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话。在这里赢了，所有宝可梦都会听你的！","Hmph. You won, I admit it. But my badge is not something I hand over for one battle.":"哼。你赢了，我承认。但我的徽章可不是赢一场就能拿走的。","North of this Gym, across the water, is the Dragon's Den. The Elder of our clan lives in its shrine. If he says you are worthy, the badge is yours.":"这座道馆北边，过了水就是龙穴。我们一族的长老住在里面的祠堂。如果他认为你够格，徽章就归你。","The Pokémon League is at the end of Victory Road. Surf east from New Bark Town along Route 27. Do not lose before you get there!":"宝可梦联盟在冠军之路的尽头。从若叶镇沿27号道路往东冲浪。在到达之前可别输了！","What are you waiting for? The Dragon's Den is north of the Gym, across the water. Go and face the Elder.":"还在等什么？龙穴在道馆北边，过了水就到。去见长老吧。","Across the pond is the Dragon's Den. The Elder of the dragon clan keeps the shrine inside. Lance trained there as a boy.":"池塘对面就是龙穴。龙之一族的长老守着里面的祠堂。阿渡小时候就在那里修行。","Clair wears a cape just like her cousin Lance. Everyone in town knows they are family.":"小椿和她的堂兄阿渡一样披着斗篷。镇上的人都知道他们是一家人。","You came through the Ice Path? Brr! The Pokémon Center is the place to warm up.":"你是从冰之洞过来的？好冷！去宝可梦中心暖和暖和吧。","Clair's dragons shrug off Fire, Water, Grass and Electric moves. Ice and Dragon moves are what hurt them.":"小椿的龙不怕火、水、草和电属性的招式。能伤到它们的是冰和龙属性的招式。","You have all eight Johto badges? Then the Pokémon League is next. Victory Road waits for you!":"你集齐城都的八枚徽章了？那下一站就是宝可梦联盟了。冠军之路在等着你！","The dragon clan has lived in Blackthorn for generations. Clair and Lance are its most famous Trainers.":"龙之一族世世代代住在烟墨市。小椿和阿渡是族里最有名的训练家。","Dragons are strong, but they hate the cold. I always carry Ice moves when I visit Blackthorn.":"龙很强，但是很怕冷。我来烟墨市的时候总会带着冰属性招式。","Clair's Gym is the last one in Johto. Trainers who win there go on to the Pokémon League.":"小椿的道馆是城都最后一座道馆。在那里赢了的训练家就会前往宝可梦联盟。","Lance is from Blackthorn, you know. He has a Dragonite! When I grow up I want one too.":"阿渡是烟墨市出身的哦。他有一只快龙！我长大了也想要一只。","Three Dratini, raised together. Can you handle all of them?":"三只一起长大的迷你龙。你对付得了吗？","Dratini shed their skin as they grow. One day mine will be as big as Clair's.":"迷你龙会一边蜕皮一边长大。总有一天我的会和小椿的一样大。","You pushed a boulder across the chasm? Not bad. But dragons do not need bridges!":"你把石头推进去过了深渊？还不错。不过龙可不需要桥！","My dragons came down to earth...":"我的龙落地了……","Clair trains harder than anyone in the clan. She cannot stand losing.":"小椿比族里任何人都努力训练。她最受不了输。","Only one more chasm between you and Clair. I am the last wall!":"你和小椿之间只剩一道深渊了。我就是最后一道墙！","The wall came down.":"墙倒了。","Clair will not go easy on you just because you made it this far.":"就算你走到了这里，小椿也不会手下留情的。","So you crossed the Ice Path and my chasms. I am Clair, and dragons answer to me. Not even the Elite Four take me lightly. Show me everything you have!":"你穿过了冰之洞，还越过了我的深渊啊。我是小椿，龙都听命于我。就连四天王也不敢小看我。把你的本事全拿出来吧！","My dragons... beaten? That cannot be.":"我的龙……输了？这不可能。","Darin":"达林","Outsiders in the Dragon's Den? You will have to get past me first.":"外人闯进龙穴？先过我这一关再说。","So you are the one Clair sent...":"原来你就是小椿派来的人……","Only those the clan trusts may cross to the shrine. Go on, then.":"只有一族信任的人才能渡水去祠堂。那你去吧。","Cara":"卡拉","The water here is home to dragons. Mine grew up in it!":"这里的水是龙的家。我的宝可梦就是在这里长大的！","Wild Dratini live in this water. If you are lucky, you might hook one.":"这片水里住着野生的迷你龙。运气好的话，说不定能钓到一只。","The Elder sees into the hearts of Trainers. Nothing is hidden from him.":"长老能看透训练家的内心。什么都瞒不过他。","Clair and Lance both learned here. Lance passed the Elder's test on his first try, they say.":"小椿和阿渡都在这里学习过。听说阿渡第一次就通过了长老的考验。","Elder":"长老","Move Deleter":"招式遗忘者","Blackthorn City. A quiet town in the mountains, home of the dragon clan.":"烟墨市。宁静的山间城镇，龙之一族的故乡。","North, across the water: the Dragon's Den. Sacred ground of the dragon clan. Do not disturb.":"北边，过水即到：龙穴。龙之一族的圣地。请勿打扰。","Blackthorn City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Clair, the proud Dragon Trainer.":"烟墨市宝可梦道馆。馆主：小椿，骄傲的龙使。","South: Route 45, a steep road down the mountains to Route 46.":"南：45号道路，一条陡峭的山路，下山通往46号道路。","Eggs are a mystery. Some say Pokémon find them, others that they appear by themselves. What do you think?":"蛋真是个谜。有人说是宝可梦找到的，也有人说是自己冒出来的。你觉得呢？","Ah, there you are! Professor Elm said a Trainer would come by. I am Mr. Pokémon. I travel and collect odd things.":"啊，你来了！空木博士说会有一位训练家过来。我是宝可梦爷爷，喜欢到处旅行，收集稀奇古怪的东西。","A friend of mine who runs the Day Care gave me this. Nobody knows what it is! Elm will want to study it.":"这是我一个开培育屋的朋友给我的。没人知道这是什么！空木一定会想研究它。","{player}! What a surprise to see you here in Johto!":"{player}！没想到会在城都见到你！","Mr. Pokémon and I are old friends. Let me see your Pokédex... There! Now it records the Pokémon of Johto too.":"我和宝可梦爷爷是老朋友了。让我看看你的图鉴……好了！现在它也能记录城都的宝可梦了。","Hm? A call from Elm... What! Someone broke into his lab and stole a Pokémon?":"嗯？空木打来的电话……什么！有人闯进他的研究所偷走了宝可梦？","{player}, hurry back to New Bark Town! Elm needs you.":"{player}，快回若叶镇吧！空木需要你。","...So you got one from that lab too. Some people get everything handed to them.":"……原来你也从那个研究所拿了一只。有些人什么都是别人送到手上的。","Let's see if you even deserve it. I'll knock you down!":"让我看看你配不配。我会把你打趴下！","...Tch. One win means nothing. I'll be the strongest Trainer there is, and nobody will stand in my way.":"……啧。赢一次不算什么。我会成为最强的训练家，谁也别想挡我的路。","Johto has Pokémon I have never seen in Kanto. Fill that Pokédex, {player}!":"城都有很多我在关都从没见过的宝可梦。把图鉴填满吧，{player}！","Oh, {player}! Talk to Mr. Pokémon first. He has something to show you.":"哦，{player}！先去跟宝可梦爷爷聊聊吧。他有东西要给你看。","Welcome to Cherrygrove! The Pokémon Center heals for free, the Mart sells Poké Balls, and the sea is lovely at sunset.":"欢迎来到吉花市！宝可梦中心免费治疗，友好商店卖精灵球，傍晚的大海也很美哦。","Johto Pokémon swim out there too. Got a rod? Give it a try!":"那边的海里也有城都的宝可梦在游。有钓竿吗？试试看吧！","My Pidgey was tired, so I brought it here. Pokémon Centers are the same in Kanto and Johto!":"我的波波累了，所以带它来这里。关都和城都的宝可梦中心都一样呢！","Antidotes are a must. Bug Pokémon on Route 30 love to poison you!":"解毒药是必备的。30号道路的虫属性宝可梦最喜欢让人中毒了！","Some Pokémon evolve once they really love their Trainer. Battle together, walk together, and see!":"有些宝可梦真正喜欢上训练家以后就会进化。一起战斗、一起走路，就知道了！","Joey":"阿乔","My Rattata is one in a million! Want to see? Battle!":"我的小拉达是万里挑一的！想见识一下吗？来对战吧！","What? My one-in-a-million Rattata!":"什么？我那万里挑一的小拉达！","I am going to make my Rattata even stronger. You will see!":"我要让我的小拉达变得更强。你等着瞧吧！","Mikey":"小麦","Hey, a Trainer! You know the rule: our eyes met, so we battle!":"嘿，是训练家！规矩你懂的：视线对上了，就要对战！","Wow. You are the real deal.":"哇，你是真的厉害。","Pidgey and Rattata are everywhere. That makes them easy to train!":"到处都有波波和小拉达，所以训练起来很方便！","I caught a bunch of Caterpie! Want to see them?":"我抓了一大堆绿毛虫！想看看吗？","My Caterpie need more training.":"我的绿毛虫还需要多加训练。","Caterpie evolve quickly. Soon they will be Butterfree!":"绿毛虫进化得很快。很快就会变成巴大蝶了！","My bag is full of bugs! Let them all have a go at you!":"我的包里装满了虫子！让它们一起上吧！","Not enough bugs, I guess.":"看来虫子还不够多啊。","At night, Spinarak come out in the grass. They are bugs too!":"到了晚上，草丛里会出现圆丝蛛。它们也是虫子哦！","Cherrygrove City. Sweet-smelling flowers on every street.":"吉花市。每条街上都开着芬芳的花。","Route 30. North: Mr. Pokémon's house. West: Route 31 to Violet City.":"30号道路。北：宝可梦爷爷的家。西：31号道路，通往桔梗市。","Shelves full of curiosities from all over the world.":"架子上摆满了世界各地的稀奇玩意儿。","Route 31. West: Violet City.":"31号道路。西：桔梗市。","Ah, {player}! Elm told me about your Egg. Splendid! Now let me show you something from my collection.":"啊，{player}！空木跟我说了你那颗蛋的事。太棒了！现在让我给你看看我的收藏吧。","Did you know a Pokémon can hold an item? Not one you use from your Bag: the Pokémon keeps it, and uses it by itself in battle.":"你知道宝可梦可以携带道具吗？不是从包包里使用的那种：宝可梦会自己拿着，在对战中自己使用。","A Berry it eats when it is hurt, a charm that makes its moves stronger... Here, try these two.":"受伤时吃的树果、让招式变强的护身符……来，你试试这两样。","Give one to a Pokémon from your party or your Bag, then come and show me. The Goldenrod Department Store has a new counter for held items too!":"从队伍或包包里把道具交给宝可梦拿着，然后拿来给我看看。满金百货也新开了一个携带道具的柜台哦！","Oh! Your {mon}! I have something in my collection that was made for it alone. Here, it should have it.":"哦！你的{mon}！我的收藏里有一样专门为它准备的东西。来，就该给它。","My collection grows every year. If you meet a Pokémon I have never seen, bring it to me!":"我的收藏每年都在增加。要是你遇到了我没见过的宝可梦，就带来给我看吧！","Give an item to one of your Pokémon, then show me. Choose it in your party, or give it from your Bag.":"把道具交给你的宝可梦拿着，再拿来给我看看。可以在队伍里选，也可以从包包里给。","Yes, just like that! It will use its item without you saying a word.":"对，就是这样！它会自己使用道具，不用你说一句话。","If you ever find something truly rare, do show it to me. I would trade you the best piece of my collection for it.":"要是你找到了真正稀有的东西，一定要给我看看。我愿意用收藏里最好的宝贝跟你换。","Hm? What is that shining in your Bag? A red scale... from the red Gyarados of the Lake of Rage? I have never seen one!":"嗯？你包包里闪闪发光的是什么？红色的鳞片……是愤怒之湖那条红色暴鲤龙的？我从没见过！","Would you trade it for the best piece of my collection?":"能用我收藏里最好的宝贝跟你换吗？","Ah... If you change your mind, I will be right here.":"啊……要是你改变主意了，我一直都在这里。","The Pokémon that holds the Exp. Share gets part of the Exp. from every battle, even if it never fights. Raise your young ones with it!":"拿着学习装置的宝可梦，即使不出场战斗，也能分到每场对战的一部分经验值。用它来培养你的新伙伴吧！","Oh, and Professor Oak stopped by. Your old rival {rival} went up Mt. Silver to train, and nobody has seen him since. The way is south of the Pokémon League Front Gate, on Route 28.":"对了，大木博士来过。他说你以前的劲敌{rival}上了白银山修行，之后就再也没人见过他。路在宝可梦联盟大门的南边，28号道路上。","A blue Pokémon with a flowing mane stands on the beach, looking at you...":"一只有着飘逸鬃毛的蓝色宝可梦站在海滩上，看着你……","{mon} turned and ran off across the waves!":"{mon}转过身，踏着海浪跑走了！","Suicune! I saw it! It was here, right here! Did it look at you? Lucky...":"水君！我看到了！它就在这里，就在这儿！它看你了吗？真幸运……","It ran off over the sea again. One day it will stop running, and I will be there.":"它又从海上跑走了。总有一天它会停下脚步，那时我一定会在那里。","The Pokémon that lights the Olivine Lighthouse is sick? Then this is what you need.":"照亮浅葱灯塔的宝可梦生病了？那你需要的就是这个。","Our Secret Potion. One dose, and it will be shining again. Hurry back to Olivine!":"这是我们的秘传之药。只要喝一剂，它就会重新发光。快回浅葱市吧！","Welcome to the Cianwood Pharmacy. We have medicines you will not find in any Mart.":"欢迎光临湛蓝药店。我们有在友好商店买不到的药。","My husband trains too much. But I would not want him any other way.":"我丈夫训练得太拼了。不过我就喜欢他这样。","Oh, a Trainer! My husband is the Gym Leader, Chuck. He trains from dawn to dusk.":"哎呀，是训练家！我丈夫是道馆馆主阿四。他从早到晚都在训练。","Here, take this. It is his favourite move: it makes a Pokémon stronger and tougher at once.":"来，这个给你。这是他最喜欢的招式：能同时让宝可梦变得更强、更结实。","WAHAHAH! I am going back under the waterfall. I will be even stronger next time!":"哇哈哈哈！我要回瀑布底下修行了。下次我会变得更强！","Yo, Champion! Chuck uses Fighting types. Flying and Psychic moves are what they fear.":"哟，冠军！阿四用的是格斗属性的宝可梦。它们害怕飞行和超能力属性的招式。","The boulders in here need Strength. And his Poliwrath can put you to sleep: bring Awakenings!":"这里的大石头需要用怪力推开。还有，他的蚊香泳士会催眠：记得带解眠药！","With four Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 40 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 50!":"有四枚城都徽章，40级以下的宝可梦会听你的。在这里赢了，就能提高到50级！","WAHAHAH! Here! The Storm Badge! You have earned it!":"哇哈哈哈！拿去！打击徽章！这是你应得的！","{player} received the Storm Badge from Chuck!":"{player}从阿四那里得到了打击徽章！","With the Storm Badge, Pokémon up to level 50 will listen to you.":"有了打击徽章，50级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话。","Take this too! TM01, Focus Punch! Gather all your power, then strike! Just do not get hit while you gather it!":"这个也拿去！招式学习器01，真气拳！集中全身的力量，然后一拳打出去！只是蓄力的时候可别被打中！","I swam all the way out to this sandbank. Now I am too tired to swim back!":"我一路游到这片沙洲。现在累得游不回去了！","The sea is my training ground. Let's make waves!":"大海就是我的训练场。来掀起浪花吧！","Washed out...":"被冲走了……","Watch out for Tentacool. They sting!":"小心玛瑙水母。它们会蜇人！","Elaine":"伊莲","Staryu shines like a jewel in the water. Isn't it pretty?":"海星星在水里像宝石一样闪闪发光。很漂亮吧？","My jewel lost its shine...":"我的宝石失去光泽了……","At night the Lighthouse light reaches all the way out here.":"到了晚上，灯塔的光一直照到这里。","Swimming is good for you, and so is battling!":"游泳对身体好，对战也是！","I need a rest on the sand...":"我得在沙滩上休息一下……","Cianwood is a long swim west. Take a break on the sandbank!":"往西游到湛蓝市还有很远。在沙洲上歇一歇吧！","Randall":"阿兰道","The currents around the islands are fierce. Only the strong swim here!":"岛屿周围的海流很猛烈。只有强者才能在这里游泳！","Swept away...":"被卷走了……","A huge Pokémon is said to sleep deep inside the Whirl Islands.":"据说漩涡列岛的深处沉睡着一只巨大的宝可梦。","Kaylee":"凯莉莉","Seaking swims as gracefully as a dancer. Watch!":"金鱼王游起来像舞者一样优雅。看好了！","Out of step...":"乱了节拍……","Seaking fight over the best spots in the river. Even in the sea, they are proud.":"金鱼王会为了争夺河里最好的位置而打架。就算在海里，它们也很骄傲。","I have swum around all four islands today. One more battle!":"我今天绕着四座岛游了一圈。再来一场对战！","Cianwood is just west of here. Its Gym Leader trains under a waterfall!":"湛蓝市就在西边。那里的道馆馆主在瀑布底下修行！","Suicune was right here! It ran off over the waves before I could get close. But I will catch up with it, you will see!":"水君刚才就在这里！我还没靠近，它就踏着海浪跑掉了。不过我一定会追上它的，你等着瞧！","Chuck trains under a waterfall every morning. He shouts so loud you can hear him across town!":"阿四每天早上都在瀑布底下修行。他喊得超大声，全镇都听得到！","The rocks here are full of Shuckle. They keep Berries in their shells until they turn to juice.":"这里的岩石间住着很多壶壶。它们把树果藏在壳里，直到变成果汁。","I came to train with Chuck. Three days in, I can barely lift my arms!":"我是来跟阿四一起修行的。才三天，我的手臂就快抬不起来了！","People sail all the way from Olivine for the medicine here.":"大家会从浅葱市坐船过来买这里的药。","A Poliwrath, flexing its arms. Even Chuck's house Pokémon trains.":"蚊香泳士正在秀肌肉。就连阿四家里的宝可梦也在锻炼。","A blue Pokémon with a long mane runs across the water as if it were land. They call it the north wind's spirit.":"有一只长着长鬃毛的蓝色宝可梦，能像在陆地上一样在水面奔跑。人们叫它北风的化身。","Chuck looks scary, but he is a big softy with his wife. She is the real boss of the house!":"阿四看起来很可怕，但在老婆面前可温柔了。她才是家里真正的老大！","Yoshi":"阿吉","Hyah! My kicks are sharper than any sword!":"哈！我的踢腿比任何刀剑都锋利！","My legs gave out...":"我的腿没力了……","Chuck can punch a boulder out of the way. You will need Strength.":"阿四一拳就能把大石头打开。你得用怪力才行。","Lao":"阿劳","Punch after punch! Can you keep up?":"一拳接一拳！你跟得上吗？","Out-punched...":"拳头输了……","Fighting types hate Psychic and Flying moves. Do not tell Chuck I said so.":"格斗属性最怕超能力和飞行属性的招式。别告诉阿四是我说的。","I train every day with Chuck. Feel the power!":"我每天都和阿四一起修行。感受一下这股力量吧！","More training...":"还得多练……","Machoke wears a belt to hold back its strength. Scary, right?":"豪力系着腰带来压住自己的力量。很吓人吧？","Lung":"阿龙","My Mankey get angry fast. And angry means strong!":"我的猴怪很容易生气。生气就代表很强！","They are even angrier now...":"它们现在更生气了……","Chuck's Poliwrath can put you to sleep and then punch. Bring Awakenings!":"阿四的蚊香泳士会先让你睡着再出拳。记得带解眠药！","WAHAHAH! So you came all the way across the sea to battle me? I am Chuck! My Pokémon and I train under the waterfall every day. Come on, let us see your strength!":"哇哈哈哈！你是特地渡海来跟我对战的吗？我就是阿四！我和我的宝可梦每天都在瀑布底下修行。来吧，让我看看你的力量！","Hwaaah! You are strong! I am shocked!":"哇啊——！你好强！我太震惊了！","Sea Route 40. Olivine City to the east, Cianwood City far to the west.":"40号水路。东边是浅葱市，往西很远是湛蓝市。","Cianwood City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Chuck, whose fists do the talking.":"湛蓝市宝可梦道馆。馆主：阿四，用拳头说话的男人。","Cianwood Pharmacy. Our secret recipes have healed Pokémon for five hundred years.":"湛蓝药店。我们的秘方治疗宝可梦已有五百年历史。","Cianwood City. A port town of rough seas and rough rocks.":"湛蓝市。海浪汹涌、岩石嶙峋的港口城市。","Whirl Islands. Fierce whirlpools swirl in front of the caves. Only a Pokémon that knows Whirlpool can calm them.":"漩涡列岛。洞窟前卷着猛烈的漩涡。只有会潮旋的宝可梦才能让它们平静下来。","Whoa, careful! It is so dark in here that I cannot even see my own boots.":"哇，小心！这里黑得我连自己的靴子都看不见。","The last earthquake dropped rocks all over these passages. I have been smashing my way through them for days.":"上次地震让这些通道到处都是落石。我已经一路敲碎它们走了好几天了。","You look like you need this more than I do. HM06 is Rock Smash: a Pokémon that knows it can break cracked rocks.":"看来你比我更需要这个。秘传学习器06是碎岩：会这招的宝可梦可以敲碎有裂缝的岩石。","Sometimes a Pokémon is hiding under a rock. The Dunsparce here love the dark!":"有时候岩石底下会躲着宝可梦。这里的土龙弟弟最喜欢黑暗了！","Smash the cracked rocks and keep going. They say there is a hollow somewhere in here where the sun comes in.":"敲碎有裂缝的岩石，继续往前走吧。听说这里面某个地方有一处洼地，阳光会照进来。","Light pours in through a crack high above. In the middle of the sunlit hollow, a lone tree is hung with black fruit.":"光线从高处的裂缝倾泻而下。在洒满阳光的洼地中央，一棵孤零零的树上挂着黑色的果实。","Gordon":"戈登","I come down here to train in the dark. My Pokémon can feel their way better than any light!":"我来这里是为了在黑暗中修行。我的宝可梦摸黑走路比开着灯还要厉害！","I did not see that coming. Then again, I see nothing down here.":"没看出来会这样。不过话说回来，在这底下我本来就什么都看不见。","The rocks here are all cracked from the last earthquake. A good Rock Smash clears them.":"这里的岩石都在上次地震时裂开了。用碎岩就能把它们清掉。","Kaito":"海斗","Training in total darkness sharpens every sense. Let me test mine on you!":"在一片漆黑中修行，能磨练所有的感官。让我拿你来试试我的感官吧！","My senses were sharp, but your Pokémon were sharper.":"我的感官很敏锐，可你的宝可梦更敏锐。","Past that rock, the river runs to a place where light comes down from above. Strange, in a cave like this.":"过了那块岩石，河水会流到一个有光从上方照下来的地方。在这样的洞穴里，真是奇怪。","...You again. I came here because people said a legendary Pokémon sleeps under this tower.":"……又是你。我来这里，是因为听说这座塔下面沉睡着传说中的宝可梦。","If I catch a legendary Pokémon, nobody will ever beat me. Not even you. Starting now!":"只要抓到传说中的宝可梦，就再也没人能打败我。就连你也不行。现在就来证明！","...Hmph. This tower is a waste of time. Nothing here but rubble and old stories.":"……哼。这座塔根本是浪费时间。除了瓦砾和老掉牙的故事，什么都没有。","Three Pokémon are sleeping in the dust. As you come closer, they open their eyes...":"三只宝可梦在尘土中沉睡着。你一走近，它们就睁开了眼睛……","{mon} jumped out through the broken floor and ran off!":"{mon}从破损的地板跃了出去，跑走了！","Did you see that? Suicune! The one I have chased for ten years!":"你看到了吗？水君！我追寻了十年的水君！","I am Eusine. Legends say a great Pokémon brought three Pokémon back to life here, after the fire: Raikou, Entei and Suicune.":"我叫阿桔。传说那场大火之后，一只伟大的宝可梦在这里让三只宝可梦复活了：雷公、炎帝和水君。","Now they are awake and running all over Johto. I will find Suicune before anyone else does!":"现在它们醒了，正在城都各地奔跑。我一定要比任何人都先找到水君！","Long ago, Ecruteak had two towers. In the east, the Bell Tower; in the west, the Brass Tower.":"很久以前，圆朱市有两座塔。东边是铃铛塔，西边是黄铜塔。","One night, lightning struck the Brass Tower. It burned for three days, until rain from the sky put the fire out.":"某天夜里，闪电击中了黄铜塔。大火烧了三天三夜，直到天降大雨才熄灭。","Three Pokémon died in the fire. But a great rainbow Pokémon came down from the sky and brought them back to life.":"有三只宝可梦死在了那场大火里。但一只彩虹色的伟大宝可梦从天而降，让它们复活了。","That is the story. The burned tower has stood empty ever since... or so they say.":"故事就是这样。从那以后，烧焦的塔就一直空着……至少大家是这么说的。","What a show! The Kimono Girls dance even better after a good battle.":"真是精彩的表演！舞子们打完一场好对战后，跳得更好了。","Battle all five Kimono Girls, young one, and I will give you something special.":"年轻人，去和五位舞子都对战一次吧，我会送你特别的东西。","Bravo! You beat all five Kimono Girls. Such battles deserve a reward. Here!":"太精彩了！你打败了五位舞子。这样的对战值得奖励。拿去吧！","The legendary Pokémon chose to run from us. But I believe one of them will appear before you, one day.":"传说中的宝可梦选择了离我们而去。但我相信，总有一天它们之中会有一只出现在你面前。","Suicune runs like the north wind and purifies dirty water. I have to see it again!":"水君像北风一样奔跑，能净化污浊的水。我一定要再见它一面！","If you meet it before me, tell me everything!":"要是你比我先遇到它，一定要全部告诉我！","I am Morty, the Gym Leader of Ecruteak. They say three Pokémon sleep under this tower, waiting for the right Trainer.":"我是圆朱市的道馆馆主松叶。据说这座塔下沉睡着三只宝可梦，在等待命中注定的训练家。","The floor is broken in places. Careful you do not fall through... or maybe that is exactly what you should do.":"地板有些地方已经塌了。小心别掉下去……或者，那正是你该做的。","The Gym is empty. A note on the door reads: \"At the Burned Tower. Morty\"":"道馆里没有人。门上的纸条写着：“我在烧焦塔。松叶”","A Sage blocks the way: Only those the Bell Tower accepts may enter. Please go back.":"一位和尚挡住了去路：只有被铃铛塔认可的人才能进入。请回吧。","Yo, Champion! Morty uses Ghost types. Normal and Fighting moves pass right through them, but Dark and Ghost moves hit hard.":"哟，冠军！松叶用的是幽灵属性的宝可梦。一般和格斗属性的招式会直接穿过它们，但恶属性和幽灵属性的招式很有效。","The floor here is hard to see. Step off the path and you will be back at the door. Watch where the Trainers stand!":"这里的地面很难看清楚。一离开道路，就会回到门口。留意训练家站的位置吧！","With three Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 35 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 40!":"有三枚城都徽章，35级以下的宝可梦会听你的。在这里赢了，就能提高到40级！","You have earned this. The Fog Badge.":"这是你应得的。幻影徽章。","{player} received the Fog Badge from Morty!":"{player}从松叶那里得到了幻影徽章！","With the Fog Badge, Pokémon up to level 40 will listen to you.":"有了幻影徽章，40级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话。","And take this: TM30, Shadow Ball. A ball of shadow that can lower the target's defence against special moves.":"还有这个：招式学习器30，暗影球。这团暗影球能降低对手的特防。","Long ago, a rainbow-coloured Pokémon perched on top of the Bell Tower. We still wait for it to come back.":"很久以前，一只彩虹色的宝可梦曾栖息在铃铛塔顶。我们至今仍在等它回来。","The Burned Tower was struck by lightning, and it burned for three days! My grandpa told me.":"烧焦塔被闪电击中，烧了整整三天！是我爷爷告诉我的。","We Kimono Girls dance at the theater. Come and watch us, and maybe battle us too!":"我们舞子在歌舞练场跳舞。来看看吧，说不定还能和我们对战哦！","Morty, our Gym Leader, went to the Burned Tower. He says something sleeps beneath it.":"我们的道馆馆主松叶去了烧焦塔。他说那下面沉睡着什么。","Three Pokémon ran out of the Burned Tower! They were gone before I could even blink.":"有三只宝可梦从烧焦塔里冲了出来！我还没眨眼，它们就不见了。","The road north of Ecruteak leads to Mahogany Town and the Lake of Rage. I heard there is a red Gyarados up there!":"圆朱市北边的路通往卡吉镇和愤怒之湖。听说那里出现了一只红色的暴鲤龙！","Ghost Pokémon put you to sleep and then eat your dreams. Bring Awakenings to Morty's Gym!":"幽灵宝可梦会让你睡着，再吃掉你的梦。去松叶的道馆记得带上解眠药！","Grandpa tells that old story every night. I know it by heart!":"爷爷每天晚上都讲那个老故事。我都会背了！","My son wants to be a Kimono Girl. I told him they are all girls... He said he will just be the first boy!":"我儿子想当舞子。我跟他说舞子都是女孩子……他说那他就当第一个男孩子！","I can already dance as well as an Espeon. Look! ...Okay, maybe as well as a Slowpoke.":"我已经跳得跟太阳伊布一样好了。你看！……好吧，大概跟呆呆兽差不多。","The Kimono Girls dance with their Pokémon as if they were one. It gives me goosebumps every time!":"舞子们和宝可梦跳起舞来，就像融为一体。每次看都让我起鸡皮疙瘩！","Naoko":"直子","You want to battle on the stage? Then let us dance! Flareon, show them your flames.":"你想在舞台上对战？那就来跳舞吧！火伊布，让他们看看你的火焰。","Our dance burned out...":"我们的舞蹈燃尽了……","Flareon's fur is warm, like a little sun.":"火伊布的毛暖暖的，像个小太阳。","Sayo":"小夜","Espeon can sense your next move before you make it. Let us see!":"太阳伊布能在你出招之前就感知到。来试试吧！","It sensed it... and still lost.":"它感知到了……可还是输了。","Espeon evolves from an Eevee that loves its Trainer, in the daytime.":"非常亲近训练家的伊布在白天进化，就会变成太阳伊布。","Zuki":"小月","Umbreon shines in the moonlight. Our dance is for the night!":"月亮伊布会在月光下发光。我们的舞蹈属于夜晚！","The moon went behind a cloud...":"月亮躲到云后面去了……","Umbreon evolves from an Eevee that loves its Trainer, at night.":"非常亲近训练家的伊布在晚上进化，就会变成月亮伊布。","Kuni":"小邦","Vaporeon's dance flows like water. Can you keep up?":"水伊布的舞姿像流水一样。你跟得上吗？","We were washed away...":"我们被冲走了……","A Water Stone turns Eevee into Vaporeon. Simple, but so beautiful.":"用水之石就能让伊布变成水伊布。很简单，却好美丽。","Miki":"美纪","Jolteon dances fast as lightning. Ready for a shock?":"雷伊布的舞步快如闪电。准备好被电了吗？","Every one of us has a different Eevee evolution. Which one do you like best?":"我们每个人都有不同的伊布进化型。你最喜欢哪一种？","A Pokémon is sleeping here.":"这里有一只宝可梦在睡觉。","The path is there, even if you cannot see it. Can you feel it?":"路就在那里，就算你看不见。你感觉得到吗？","You felt it...":"你感觉到了……","Keep to the path. One step off it, and you will be back at the door.":"别离开道路。踏错一步，就会回到门口。","Martha":"玛莎","The spirits whisper your name... and that you will lose!":"灵魂在低语你的名字……还说你会输！","The spirits lied to me...":"灵魂骗了我……","Ghost Pokémon cannot be hit by Normal or Fighting moves. Remember that.":"一般和格斗属性的招式打不中幽灵宝可梦。记住了。","Jeffrey":"阿杰","In the dark, a Ghost Pokémon is at its strongest!":"在黑暗中，幽灵宝可梦是最强的！","The light found me...":"光明找到我了……","Morty trains here to see what others cannot. Like the path beneath your feet.":"松叶在这里修行，为了看见别人看不见的东西。就像你脚下的路。","Two Haunters, two curses! Are you scared yet?":"两只鬼斯通，两个诅咒！害怕了吗？","I am the one who is scared now...":"现在害怕的是我了……","Dark moves and Ghost moves hit Ghost Pokémon hard.":"恶属性和幽灵属性的招式对幽灵宝可梦很有效。","So you made it across. Good. I am Morty. Here in Ecruteak, we have trained since long ago to see the legendary Pokémon, and I believe that day is near. Let me see if you have the strength for it!":"你成功走过来了。很好。我是松叶。在圆朱市，我们自古以来就为了见到传说中的宝可梦而修行，我相信那一天就快到了。让我看看你有没有那份力量吧！","I see... You are stronger than I thought.":"原来如此……你比我想象的还要强。","Eusine":"阿桔","Ecruteak City. A city of history, where the past still lives.":"圆朱市。一座历史悠久、往昔依然鲜活的城市。","The Burned Tower. It burned down in a great fire long ago. Keep out: it is not safe.":"烧焦塔。很久以前在一场大火中烧毁了。危险，请勿进入。","Ecruteak City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Morty, the mystic who sees what is yet to come.":"圆朱市宝可梦道馆。馆主：松叶，能看见未来的神秘之人。","The Bell Tower. Only those the tower accepts may climb it.":"铃铛塔。只有被塔认可的人才能登上。","The Dance Theater. The Kimono Girls dance every day.":"歌舞练场。舞子们每天都在这里跳舞。","So the Champion of Johto has come. Listen: at night the Bell Tower's bell rings by itself, with no one there to ring it.":"城都的冠军来了啊。听我说：到了夜里，铃铛塔的钟会自己响起来，明明没有人去敲。","The Sages say the rainbow Pokémon is calling for a Trainer. I think that Trainer is you. Take this: the Clear Bell.":"贤者们说，彩虹色的宝可梦正在呼唤一位训练家。我想那就是你。收下这个吧：透明铃铛。","Show it to the Sage at the Bell Tower. Its ring will open the way.":"拿给铃铛塔的贤者看吧。它的铃声会为你开路。","Raikou is back! Thunder crackles all around it.":"雷公回来了！它的周围雷光噼啪作响。","Raikou is still standing there, watching you.":"雷公还站在那里，注视着你。","Entei is back! The air shimmers with heat around it.":"炎帝回来了！它周围的空气因高温而扭曲。","Entei is still standing there, watching you.":"炎帝还站在那里，注视着你。","The Clear Bell! Its ring is the tower's welcome. Go in: the tower has been waiting for you.":"是透明铃铛！它的铃声就是塔对你的欢迎。进去吧：塔一直在等你。","Ho-Oh has come back to the Bell Tower! I never thought I would live to see it.":"凤王回到铃铛塔了！我从没想过这辈子能亲眼看到。","There is more to the story. The Brass Tower had a guardian too, a great silver Pokémon. When the tower burned, it flew off to the sea.":"故事还没完。黄铜塔也有一位守护者，是一只巨大的银色宝可梦。塔烧起来的时候，它飞向了大海。","This feather was found in the ashes, and my family has kept it ever since. Take it: I think it has been waiting for you.":"这根羽毛是在灰烬里找到的，从那以后一直由我家保管。收下吧：我想它一直在等你。","They say the silver Pokémon sleeps deep under the Whirl Islands, beyond whirlpools no boat can cross.":"据说那只银色的宝可梦沉睡在漩涡列岛的深处，被船只无法通过的漩涡挡在后面。","An old sailor in Cianwood knows how to calm them. Go and find him.":"湛蓝市有一位老水手知道怎么让漩涡平静下来。去找他吧。","The Silver Wing will lead you to the guardian of the sea, deep under the Whirl Islands.":"银色之羽会带你去见大海的守护者，就在漩涡列岛的深处。","So you met the guardian of the sea as well. Ho-Oh and Lugia both... the old stories live again.":"原来你连大海的守护者也见到了。凤王和洛奇亚都……古老的传说又活过来了。","Kurt of Azalea Town once told me he dreamed of making a ball fit for such Pokémon. Go and tell him what you saw.":"桧皮镇的钢铁曾经跟我说过，他梦想做出配得上这些宝可梦的球。去把你看到的告诉他吧。","I cried a little... okay, a lot. But I will get stronger, and next time I will win!":"我哭了一下下……好吧，哭了很久。不过我会变得更强，下次一定赢你！","Sniff... I am sorry. I always cry when I lose. You won fair and square, so here you go.":"呜……对不起。我一输就会哭。你赢得光明正大，这个给你。","{player} received the Plain Badge from Whitney!":"{player}从小茜那里得到了常规徽章！","With the Plain Badge, Pokémon up to level 35 will listen to you.":"有了常规徽章，35级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话。","And take this too. It is TM45, Attract. If the other Pokémon is of the opposite gender, it may be too smitten to fight!":"这个也给你。是招式学习器45，迷人。如果对手是异性的宝可梦，它可能会着迷到无法战斗哦！","I will train even harder now. And I will try not to cry so much... maybe.":"我会更努力地训练的。也会试着别那么爱哭……大概吧。","{player}? Is that you? It is me, Bill! I am home in Goldenrod for a few days to see my family.":"{player}？是你吗？是我，正辉！我回满金市住几天，来看看家人。","You helped me out back in Kanto, so let me return the favour. I have been looking after an Eevee, and I think it would love to travel with you.":"你在关都帮过我，这次让我来报答你吧。我一直在照顾一只伊布，我想它一定很乐意跟你一起旅行。","Will you take Eevee?":"你愿意带走伊布吗？","Okay. If you change your mind, I will be here.":"好吧。如果你改变主意了，我就在这里。","Your party is full, so I sent Eevee to your PC. My system at work!":"你的队伍满了，所以我把伊布传送到你的电脑里了。这就是我的系统！","Eevee can evolve in many different ways. A stone, the time of day, how much it loves you... I wonder which one yours will become?":"伊布有很多种进化方式。石头、时间、它有多喜欢你……不知道你的伊布会进化成哪一种呢？","Hello, hello! I am the Name Rater. I judge the names of Pokémon.":"你好你好！我是姓名鉴定师，专门评鉴宝可梦的名字。","Shall I rate the name of one of your Pokémon?":"要我来鉴定一下你的宝可梦的名字吗？","Come back any time.":"随时欢迎再来。","Rate which Pokémon?":"鉴定哪只宝可梦？","{mon}... A splendid name! Its first Trainer chose it with love. I would not dare change it.":"{mon}……真是个好名字！这是它的第一位训练家用心取的，我可不敢改。","{mon}... A fine name, but it could be finer. Shall I give it a new one?":"{mon}……名字不错，但还可以更好。要给它取个新名字吗？","{mon} it is! Much better than before.":"就叫{mon}吧！比之前好多了。","Welcome to the Trainer's Market! Everything you need for the road.":"欢迎光临训练家市场！旅途所需应有尽有。","Here we have the strongest medicine in Johto.":"我们这里有城都最有效的药。","Technical Machines! One disc, and your Pokémon learns a new move.":"招式学习器！只要一张光盘，你的宝可梦就能学会新招式。","Battle items and vitamins! Make your Pokémon stronger, for a battle or for good.":"对战道具和营养剂！让你的宝可梦变强，可以只在一场对战中，也可以是永久的。","The station is closed. A note on the door reads: \"The Magnet Train is not running. We are sorry!\"":"车站关闭着。门上的告示写着：“磁浮列车暂停运行，非常抱歉！”","Staff only beyond this point.":"前方仅限工作人员进入。","Yo, Champion! Whitney uses Normal types. Fighting moves hit them hard!":"哟，冠军！小茜用的是一般属性的宝可梦。格斗属性的招式对它们很有效！","Her Miltank's Rollout gets stronger every turn it keeps rolling. Switching Pokémon stops it, and so does a miss.":"她的大奶罐的滚动每多滚一回合就会更强。替换宝可梦能让它停下来，没打中也会停。","With two Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 30 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 35!":"有两枚城都徽章，30级以下的宝可梦会听你的。在这里赢了，就能提高到35级！","Waaaah! You meanie! I lost! Sob... sob...":"哇啊啊——！你好过分！我输了！呜……呜……","Whitney's Miltank knows Rollout. Once it starts rolling, it just keeps going, faster and faster!":"小茜的大奶罐会滚动。它一滚起来就停不下来，而且越滚越快！","The Radio Tower plays music all day long. My favourite is the lullaby they play at night.":"广播塔一整天都在播放音乐。我最喜欢晚上播的那首摇篮曲。","Did you know Bill, the man who made the PC storage system, grew up here? His family still lives in that house.":"你知道吗？发明电脑寄放系统的正辉就是在这里长大的。他的家人现在还住在那栋房子里。","The Department Store has everything! I always end up buying far too much.":"百货公司里什么都有！我每次都会买太多东西。","The Magnet Train runs to Saffron City in Kanto. Right now the power supply has a problem, so it is stopped.":"磁浮列车通往关都的金黄市。现在电力供应出了问题，所以停开了。","With so many Trainers in Goldenrod, this Pokémon Center is busy all day.":"满金市的训练家这么多，这里的宝可梦中心一整天都很忙。","Welcome to the Goldenrod Department Store! The stairs to the upper floors are on the right.":"欢迎光临满金百货！上楼的楼梯在右边。","I came to buy one Potion, and now my bag is full. How does that always happen?":"我本来只想买一瓶伤药，结果包包都装满了。怎么每次都这样？","A vitamin makes a Pokémon stronger for good. They are expensive, but they work!":"营养剂能让宝可梦永久变强。虽然很贵，但真的有效！","Welcome to the Radio Tower! I am sorry, but the floors upstairs are for staff only.":"欢迎来到广播塔！不好意思，楼上只有工作人员才能进去。","Our shows reach every town in Johto. On a clear day, they can even hear us in Kanto!":"我们的节目能传到城都的每个城镇。天气好的时候，连关都都听得到！","I listen to the Pokémon Talk show every day. The host chats with Professor Oak!":"我每天都听宝可梦访谈节目。主持人会和大木博士聊天哦！","Welcome to the Bike Shop! ...Oh, you already have a Bicycle from Kanto? Good choice. Take care of it, and it will take care of you.":"欢迎光临自行车店！……哦，你已经有一辆关都的自行车了？眼光不错。好好爱惜它，它也会好好帮你。","With a Bicycle you can ride all over Johto. I am saving up my pocket money for one!":"有了自行车，就能骑遍整个城都。我正在存零用钱买一辆！","Welcome! Our flowers come from every corner of Johto.":"欢迎光临！我们的花来自城都的各个角落。","Have you heard about the strange tree west of Violet City? They say it wiggles when you water it. A tree that moves... how odd!":"你听说过桔梗市西边那棵奇怪的树吗？据说给它浇水的话，它会扭来扭去。会动的树……真奇怪！","How is your Eevee doing? I hope you two are getting along.":"你的伊布还好吗？希望你们相处得不错。","Bill came home for a few days. He spends the whole time talking to his PC... Some things never change.":"正辉回家住几天。结果他一直在对着电脑说话……有些事真是一点都没变。","Pokémon left at the Day Care on Route 34 come back stronger. They grow a little with every step you take!":"寄放在34号道路培育屋的宝可梦回来时都会变强。你每走一步，它们就会成长一点哦！","Whitney cried when she lost to my big brother. She is really strong, but she is a crybaby!":"小茜输给我哥哥的时候哭了。她真的很强，可就是个爱哭鬼！","Oh, Whitney is crying again... She always cries when she loses. Talk to her once more, she will cheer up soon.":"唉，小茜又在哭了……她每次输了都会哭。再跟她说一次话吧，她很快就会好起来的。","Victoria":"维琪","Whitney is so cute. Everyone wants to be like her! Me too!":"小茜好可爱。大家都想变得跟她一样！我也是！","Not cute enough...":"还是不够可爱……","Whitney's Miltank gives the best milk. It also hits the hardest.":"小茜的大奶罐挤出的牛奶最好喝。它打起人来也最痛。","Samantha":"小珊","My Meowth and I will scratch you up!":"我和我的喵喵要把你抓得满身伤！","My Meowth lost its claws...":"我的喵喵爪子都没了……","Normal types have no weaknesses... except for Fighting moves.":"一般属性没有弱点……除了格斗属性的招式。","Snubbull may look tough, but it is really sweet. Unlike me in battle!":"布鲁看起来很凶，其实很温柔。对战时的我可就不一样了！","So mean...":"好过分……","When Miltank uses Attract, a Pokémon of the other gender falls for it and forgets to fight.":"大奶罐使出迷人时，异性的宝可梦会被迷住，忘了战斗。","Three Jigglypuff, three times the fun!":"三只胖丁，三倍的快乐！","They all fell asleep...":"它们全都睡着了……","Whitney's Clefairy can use Encore. Then your Pokémon has to repeat the same move again and again.":"小茜的皮皮会再来一次。这样你的宝可梦就只能一直重复同一个招式。","Hi! I am Whitney! Everybody was into Pokémon, so I got into them too. They are just so cute! You want to battle? Okay, but I am warning you, I am good!":"嗨！我是小茜！大家都迷上了宝可梦，所以我也迷上啦。它们实在太可爱了！你想对战？好呀，不过我先说好，我可是很厉害的！","No way... I lost...":"不会吧……我输了……","Name Rater":"姓名鉴定师","Goldenrod City. Johto's great city, busy and bright from morning to night.":"满金市。城都的大城市，从早到晚都热闹又明亮。","Goldenrod City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Whitney, the cheerful queen of Normal types!":"满金市宝可梦道馆。馆主：小茜，开朗的一般属性女王！","The Goldenrod Department Store, the biggest shop in Johto, is on the west side of the city.":"城都最大的商店——满金百货，就在城市的西边。","Magnet Train Station. The fastest way to Kanto, once it runs again.":"磁浮列车站。等它恢复运行，就是去关都最快的方式。","Floor guide. 1F: Information. 2F: Trainer's Market. 3F: TMs, battle items and vitamins.":"楼层导览。1楼：服务台。2楼：训练家市场。3楼：招式学习器、对战道具和营养剂。","Oh, you have the Plain Badge! Then you are strong enough to deal with that strange tree on Route 36.":"哦，你拿到常规徽章了！那你应该有本事对付36号道路上那棵奇怪的树了。","Take this Squirt Bottle. If you water the tree, I bet something will happen!":"这个杰尼龟喷壶给你。要是给那棵树浇浇水，肯定会发生什么事！","That strange tree on Route 36... I would water it myself, but only a strong Trainer should go near it. Win a badge from Whitney first!":"36号道路上那棵奇怪的树……我本想自己去浇水，但只有厉害的训练家才该靠近它。先从小茜那里赢一枚徽章吧！","North: Route 35 and the National Park.":"北：35号道路和自然公园。","The radio only plays Team Rocket now. They have taken over the whole Radio Tower!":"现在收音机里只有火箭队的声音。他们占领了整座广播塔！","The lullaby is back on the radio at night. Thank you for chasing Team Rocket away!":"晚上收音机里又播起摇篮曲了。谢谢你赶走了火箭队！","The Radio Tower belongs to Team Rocket now. Soon all of Johto will hear our call!":"广播塔现在是火箭队的了。很快整个城都都会听到我们的呼唤！","Welcome back! You saved the Radio Tower. Please, look around upstairs as much as you like.":"欢迎回来！是你救了广播塔。楼上请随便参观。","Welcome to Team Rocket Radio! Visitors are not welcome!":"欢迎收听火箭队电台！访客不受欢迎！","You are not a visitor, you are trouble...":"你不是访客，你是个麻烦……","Our executives are upstairs. You will never get to them!":"我们的干部在楼上。你绝对到不了那里！","Welcome to our new counter for held items! Give one to a Pokémon, and it will use it in battle all by itself.":"欢迎光临新开的携带道具柜台！把道具交给宝可梦拿着，它在对战中就会自己使用。","Vance":"凡斯","My Pidgeotto can fly over the mountains. Can yours?":"我的比比鸟能飞越高山。你的呢？","Flying types have it easy on mountain roads. No ice to slip on!":"飞行属性在山路上可轻松了。不会在冰上滑倒！","I foresaw that you would come this way. I did not foresee who would win, though.":"我预见到你会走这条路。不过我没预见到谁会赢。","Even my future sight was clouded...":"连我的预知能力都蒙上了雾……","The future is never fixed. That is what makes it worth training for.":"未来从来不是注定的。正因如此，训练才有意义。","Shh! You are scaring the fish. Fine, a battle it is!":"嘘！你会把鱼吓跑的。好吧，那就对战！","Remoraid shoot water like a jet. When they grow up, they latch on to things.":"铁炮鱼会像水枪一样喷水。长大以后就会吸附在东西上。","Cybil":"西贝尔","Pretty Pokémon can be strong too. Let me show you!":"可爱的宝可梦也能很强。我来证明给你看！","Beaten, but beautifully.":"输了，但输得很漂亮。","Clair of Blackthorn is the strongest Gym Leader in Johto. Are you heading her way?":"烟墨市的小椿是城都最强的道馆馆主。你要去挑战她吗？","Zach":"扎克","My Rhyhorn grew a drill on its head! Want to see what it can do?":"我的独角犀牛头上长出钻头了！想看看它的厉害吗？","The drill could not break through...":"钻头也钻不穿……","I would love a Pokémon from the Dragon's Den. Only the dragon clan may go in, though.":"好想要龙穴里的宝可梦啊。不过只有龙之一族才能进去。","Allen":"艾伦","A Trainer on the way to Blackthorn? Then you must be good. Prove it!":"要去烟墨市的训练家？那你一定很厉害。证明给我看！","The Ice Path is slippery. Think before every step, or you will slide right past where you wanted to go.":"冰之洞很滑。每走一步前都要想清楚，不然就会滑过头。","Route 44. West: Mahogany Town. East: the Ice Path.":"44号道路。西：卡吉镇。东：冰之洞。","The Ice Path. Its floors are frozen solid all year round. Blackthorn City lies on the other side.":"冰之洞。洞里的地面一年到头都冻得结结实实。另一头就是烟墨市。","I teach Headbutt. Knock it into a tree, and sleeping Pokémon come tumbling down!":"我会教头锤。往树上一撞，睡在树上的宝可梦就会滚下来！","Shall I teach Headbutt to one of your Pokémon?":"要我教你的宝可梦头锤吗？","Teach which Pokémon?":"教哪只宝可梦？","That Pokémon cannot learn it. Sorry!":"那只宝可梦学不会。抱歉啦！","Now try it on a tree. Look for the ones with lighter leaves.":"现在去找棵树试试吧。找叶子颜色比较浅的那种。","Oh no, oh no... I was cutting wood with our Farfetch'd, and it ran off into the forest!":"糟了糟了……我正和我们的大葱鸭砍柴，它却跑进森林里去了！","My master will be so angry. If you see a Farfetch'd, could you chase it back this way?":"师傅一定会大发雷霆的。要是你看到了大葱鸭，能把它往这边赶回来吗？","Kwaa! Farfetch'd hopped away into the trees!":"嘎——！大葱鸭蹦蹦跳跳地跑进树丛里了！","Kwaa! Farfetch'd ran off... back toward the forest entrance!":"嘎——！大葱鸭跑走了……朝着森林入口的方向！","So this is where my apprentice ran off to... and our Farfetch'd is back, too. You found it for him?":"原来我的徒弟跑到这里来了……我们的大葱鸭也回来了。是你帮他找到的吗？","Thank you, young Trainer. Please, take this. It is the heat of my kiln, packed into a disc.":"谢谢你，年轻的训练家。请收下这个。这是把我窑里的火候装进了光盘。","That is TM35, Flamethrower. Fire moves are tough on bugs and grass, and a strong fire never goes out!":"那是招式学习器35，喷射火焰。火属性的招式对虫和草很有效，旺盛的火是永远不会熄灭的！","Come on, you two. Back to the kiln!":"走吧，你们两个。回窑里去！","A small wooden shrine. It honours the guardian of the forest, said to travel through time.":"一座小小的木制祠堂。供奉着森林的守护神，据说它能穿越时间。","Someone has left fresh berries in front of it.":"有人在祠堂前供上了新鲜的树果。","Farfetch'd, you are back! I am never letting go of you again. Thank you so much!":"大葱鸭，你回来啦！我再也不放开你了。真是太谢谢你了！","Farfetch'd is hugging its leek. It looks tired from all that running.":"大葱鸭紧紧抱着它的葱。跑了这么久，它看起来累坏了。","Some Pokémon sleep up in the trees. Give a tree a good knock, and one might fall right on your head!":"有些宝可梦睡在树上。用力撞一撞树，说不定就有一只掉到你头上！","Wayne":"阿伟","This forest is the best place in Johto for bugs. Let me show you mine!":"这片森林是城都最适合虫宝可梦的地方。让你看看我的！","My bugs crawled away...":"我的虫子都爬走了……","Paras like the damp ground by the pond. You can find them there at night.":"派拉斯喜欢池塘边潮湿的地面。晚上可以在那里找到它们。","Apprentice":"徒弟","Charcoal Maker":"烧炭师傅","Ilex Forest. The trees grow so close together that it is dim here even at noon.":"栎树林。树木长得太密，就连正午这里也很昏暗。","A Level Ball works better the higher your own Pokémon's level is above the wild one's.":"你的宝可梦等级比野生宝可梦高得越多，等级球就越好用。","A Lure Ball is made for Pokémon you hook with a fishing rod.":"诱饵球是专门用来抓用钓竿钓上来的宝可梦的。","A Moon Ball works wonders on Pokémon that evolve with a Moon Stone.":"对用月之石进化的宝可梦，月亮球特别有效。","A Pokémon caught in a Friend Ball takes to you right away.":"用友友球抓到的宝可梦，马上就会和你亲近起来。","A Love Ball works on a Pokémon of the same species as yours, but of the other gender.":"甜蜜球对和你的宝可梦同种类、但性别相反的宝可梦有效。","A Fast Ball is made for catching very fast Pokémon, the kind that always run away.":"速度球是用来抓速度很快、总是一下子就逃掉的宝可梦的。","A Heavy Ball works better the heavier the Pokémon is. On light ones, it is worse than a plain ball.":"宝可梦越重，沉重球就越好用。对轻的宝可梦，它比普通的精灵球还差。","{player}! Look at this: my back is finally better. I can sit at my bench again!":"{player}！你看：我的腰终于好了。我又能坐到工作台前了！","The elder of Ecruteak says you met Ho-Oh and Lugia. When I heard that, my hands began to itch to make Poké Balls again.":"圆朱市的长老说你见到了凤王和洛奇亚。我一听，手就痒得想再做精灵球了。","I make them out of Apricorns, a fruit that grows on trees all over Johto. Each colour makes a different kind of ball. Keep them in this.":"我是用球果来做的，那是长在城都各地树上的果实。不同的颜色能做出不同的球。用这个装着吧。","A tree bears one Apricorn a day. There is a white one right here in town, a pink one on Route 33, a red and a blue one on Route 37, and a green and a yellow one on Route 42.":"每棵树一天结一个球果。镇上就有一棵白色的，33号道路有粉色的，37号道路有红色和蓝色的，42号道路有绿色和黄色的。","The black one is the rarest of all. The only tree I know grows in a hollow deep in the Dark Cave. Its mouth is on Route 31, just east of Violet City.":"黑色的最稀有了。我只知道一棵，长在黑暗洞穴深处的一处洼地里。洞口在31号道路上，就在桔梗市东边。","Bring me Apricorns, and I will turn them into balls right here while you wait!":"把球果拿来给我，我当场就把它们做成球，你稍等一下就好！","Bring me Apricorns, and I will make balls out of them. I have not made you a {item} yet!":"把球果拿来给我，我就用它们做球。我还没给你做过{item}呢！","Bring me Apricorns any time. A Trainer can never have too many good balls!":"随时把球果拿来给我吧。训练家的好球是永远不嫌多的！","Apricorns! Leave them to me...":"是球果啊！交给我吧……","That makes all seven kinds! I have not made a full set like this since I was a young man.":"这样七种就齐了！这么完整的一套，我从年轻时起就没再做过了。","Use them well, and come back whenever you find more Apricorns.":"好好用它们吧。找到更多球果的话，随时再来。","Oh, and the researchers at the Ruins of Alph sent word: the earthquake opened chambers that were sealed for ages. They are asking for a good Trainer to help.":"对了，阿露福遗迹的研究员捎来了消息：地震让封闭了不知多少年的石室打开了。他们在找一位厉害的训练家帮忙。","Two challenges meet at the Indigo Plateau: Kanto's Elite Four, and the Elite Four that Johto's Trainers face, with their own Champion.":"石英高原有两项挑战：关都的四天王，以及城都训练家要面对的四天王和他们的冠军。","Which challenge will you take?":"你要接受哪一项挑战？","Kanto's Elite Four":"关都四天王","I have been waiting for you, {player}. The Champion of Kanto, and now the holder of all eight of Johto's badges.":"我一直在等你，{player}。关都的冠军，如今也集齐了城都的八枚徽章。","For the Trainers of Johto, I am the last one standing in this League: its Champion. We fought together against Team Rocket. Today we fight each other, and I will hold nothing back.":"对城都的训练家来说，我是这个联盟的最后一关：冠军。我们曾一起对抗火箭队。今天我们要彼此交手，我不会有丝毫保留。","...It is over. You have beaten me once more, and this time as Johto's Champion.":"……结束了。你又一次打败了我，这次是以城都冠军的身份。","Your Pokémon fought for you with everything they had. That is a bond no dragon can break.":"你的宝可梦为你拼尽了全力。这是任何龙都无法斩断的羁绊。","Come with me. Johto's Hall of Fame is waiting for you and your team.":"跟我来。城都的殿堂正等着你和你的队伍。","So you have come to face me again, Champion. My dragons have grown stronger. Let us see how far you have come!":"你又来挑战我了，冠军。我的龙变得更强了。让我看看你成长了多少！","Still the Champion. I will be waiting for the next time.":"依然是冠军啊。我会等着下一次的。","Your team's names are written here once already, for Kanto. Today the Hall of Fame remembers them again, as the Champions of Johto.":"你的队伍的名字已经因关都写在这里一次了。今天，殿堂将再次记住它们，作为城都的冠军。","Team Rocket is gone, the Gyarados of the lake are calm, and Johto's Pokémon trust you. Go home and rest, Champion. You have earned it.":"火箭队消失了，湖里的暴鲤龙也平静了，城都的宝可梦都信任你。回家好好休息吧，冠军。这是你应得的。","Losing will not stop me. Go on: the next room holds someone far more cunning than I am.":"输了也阻止不了我。继续前进吧：下一个房间里的人比我狡猾得多。","A ninja knows when he is beaten. Go. The next of us fights with fists, not tricks.":"忍者知道自己何时输了。去吧。下一位靠的是拳头，不是计谋。","Go on. Karen is next, and she does not go easy on anyone.":"去吧。下一位是梨花，她对谁都不会手下留情。","The Champion waits beyond this door. You have met him before, I think.":"冠军就在这扇门后面等着你。我想你们以前见过面。","So you are the one who gathered all of Johto's badges. I am Will. I traveled the world to sharpen my Psychic Pokémon, and I will not lose to anyone now!":"原来你就是集齐了城都所有徽章的人。我是一树。我走遍世界磨练我的超能力宝可梦，现在我谁都不会输！","My mind... did not see this coming.":"我的心灵……竟没能预见到这个结果。","Back again, Champion? My mind has grown sharper since our battle. This time I have foreseen my victory!":"又来了吗，冠军？自从上次对战，我的心灵更加敏锐了。这次我已经预见到自己的胜利！","Fwahahaha! We meet again. I am Koga, master of the ninja arts, and now of the Elite Four. Poison, confusion and patience: no foe escapes my techniques!":"哇哈哈哈！我们又见面了。我是阿桔，忍术大师，如今也是四天王之一。剧毒、混乱与耐心：谁也逃不出我的忍术！","My techniques... seen through once more.":"我的忍术……又一次被看穿了。","You return, Champion. I have refined my poisons since our last battle. Let us see if you can still slip through them!":"你回来了，冠军。自上次对战后我又精炼了我的毒。看看你还能不能躲过去！","You again! Champion of Kanto, and now Johto's badges too. My Pokémon and I have trained in Johto's mountains since then. Hoo hah! Show me your strength once more!":"又是你！关都的冠军，现在连城都的徽章也到手了。从那以后我和我的宝可梦一直在城都的山里修行。呼哈！再让我见识一次你的力量吧！","Again... my training still falls short.":"又输了……我的修行还是不够。","Champion! I have not missed a single day of training. Hoo hah! This time my fists will reach you!":"冠军！我一天都没落下修行。呼哈！这次我的拳头一定能打中你！","I am Karen of the Elite Four. My favourite? Dark Pokémon: tough, clever and misunderstood. People call some Pokémon strong and others weak, but that is only their opinion. A real Trainer wins with the Pokémon they believe in.":"我是四天王梨花。我最喜欢的？恶属性宝可梦：坚韧、聪明，又总被误解。人们说有的宝可梦强、有的弱，那只是他们的看法。真正的训练家会和自己相信的宝可梦一起赢。","I like your style. You battle with your heart.":"我喜欢你的风格。你是用心在对战。","Karen":"梨花","You came back, Champion. Good. My Dark Pokémon have been looking forward to this.":"你回来了，冠军。很好。我的恶属性宝可梦一直期待着这一刻。","An Electrode is wired into the machine. It is powering the radio signal!":"一只顽皮雷弹被连在机器上。是它在为电波信号供电！","The machine fell silent. The radio signal has stopped!":"机器安静了下来。电波信号停止了！","Your Pokémon look tired. Here, let me help.":"你的宝可梦看起来很累了。来，我帮你一把。","The Electrode in that room are powering the signal. Stop them, and the Gyarados will calm down.":"那个房间里的顽皮雷弹在为信号供电。只要阻止它们，暴鲤龙就会平静下来。","You did it. The signal is gone, and the Gyarados in the lake will calm down.":"你做到了。信号消失了，湖里的暴鲤龙也会平静下来的。","You fight well. Take this: HM07, Waterfall. With it, a Pokémon can climb a waterfall.":"你很会战斗。收下这个：秘传学习器07，攀瀑。有了它，宝可梦就能爬上瀑布。","Pryce has opened his Gym again. We will meet again, I am sure of it.":"柳伯重新开放道馆了。我们还会再见面的，我很确定。","Team Rocket is not finished yet. Stay on your guard.":"火箭队还没有完。要保持警惕。","Welcome... Souvenirs of the Lake of Rage. Buy something, or move along.":"欢迎……愤怒之湖的纪念品。要买就买，不买就走。","The shop is mine again! Those men pushed me out. Thank you, dear. Buy something nice!":"店又是我的了！那些人把我赶了出去。谢谢你，孩子。买点好东西吧！","Ice teaches patience. Winter is hard, but spring always follows. Keep going, young one.":"冰教会人耐心。冬天虽然严酷，但春天总会到来。继续前进吧，年轻人。","A red Gyarados! It is thrashing about in a terrible rage!":"红色的暴鲤龙！它正怒不可遏地翻腾着！","Something red is floating on the water...":"水面上漂着某个红色的东西……","That Gyarados was red... You handled it well.":"那只暴鲤龙是红色的……你应对得很好。","I am Lance. I came here because the Gyarados in this lake were forced to evolve. A strange radio signal is coming from Mahogany Town.":"我是阿渡。我来这里，是因为这个湖里的暴鲤龙被强行进化了。有一股奇怪的电波从卡吉镇传出来。","Team Rocket is behind it, I am sure. Meet me at the souvenir shop in Mahogany.":"我敢肯定是火箭队在搞鬼。我们在卡吉镇的纪念品店会合吧。","The clerk was a Team Rocket Grunt. My Dragonite took care of him.":"店员是火箭队的手下。我的快龙已经收拾他了。","The stairs behind the shelf lead to their hideout. I will go ahead. Follow me!":"架子后面的楼梯通往他们的基地。我先走一步。跟上来！","Behind the shelf... a cold draft comes up from somewhere below. The clerk is watching you.":"架子后面……有一股冷风从下面吹上来。店员正盯着你。","The Gym is locked. A note reads: \"Strange signals have the town on edge. The Gym is closed until further notice. Pryce\"":"道馆锁着。纸条上写着：“奇怪的信号让镇上人心惶惶，道馆暂停开放。柳伯”","Fine, fine. You beat me. But the transmitter is powered by our Electrode, and you will never switch them all off!":"好吧好吧，你赢了。不过发射器是由我们的顽皮雷弹供电的，你绝对关不掉全部！","Yo, Champion! Pryce uses Ice types. Fire, Fighting, Rock and Steel moves are what you want.":"哟，冠军！柳伯用的是冰属性的宝可梦。用火、格斗、岩石和钢属性的招式就对了。","The floor is ice: you slide until something stops you. Use the rocks to steer!":"地板是冰做的：你会一直滑到撞上东西为止。利用岩石来控制方向吧！","With six Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 60 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 70!":"有六枚城都徽章，60级以下的宝可梦会听你的。在这里赢了，就能提高到70级！","Take this. The Glacier Badge.":"收下吧。冰雪徽章。","{player} received the Glacier Badge from Pryce!":"{player}从柳伯那里得到了冰雪徽章！","With the Glacier Badge, Pokémon up to level 70 will listen to you.":"有了冰雪徽章，70级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话。","And this: TM07, Hail. It brings down a hailstorm that hurts every Pokémon but the Ice types.":"还有这个：招式学习器07，冰雹。它会降下冰雹，伤害冰属性以外的所有宝可梦。","Have you heard? A red Gyarados was seen at the Lake of Rage, north of town!":"你听说了吗？有人在镇子北边的愤怒之湖看到了红色的暴鲤龙！","That souvenir shop is odd. The clerk never smiles, and men in black go in and never come out.":"那家纪念品店很奇怪。店员从来不笑，穿黑衣服的人进去后就再也没出来过。","The men in black are gone! And Pryce has opened his Gym again.":"穿黑衣服的人都不见了！柳伯也重新开放道馆了。","The Gyarados in the Lake of Rage have been angry for days. Something is stirring them up.":"愤怒之湖的暴鲤龙已经暴躁好几天了。一定有什么东西在刺激它们。","Pryce has trained Ice Pokémon for fifty years. He says the cold makes the heart strong.":"柳伯训练冰属性宝可梦已经五十年了。他说寒冷能让人的心变得坚强。","Pryce's Gym floor is all ice. You slide until you hit something! It is so much fun.":"柳伯道馆的地板全是冰。你会一直滑到撞上东西为止！超好玩的。","I came to see the red Gyarados, but I will settle for a battle!":"我是来看红色暴鲤龙的，不过来场对战也行！","Not even a red Gyarados could save me...":"就算是红色暴鲤龙也救不了我……","They say the Gyarados in the lake were Magikarp only a week ago.":"听说湖里的暴鲤龙一个星期前还是鲤鱼王。","Marvin":"阿文","My Magikarp are ready to flop! And my Gyarados is ready to bite!":"我的鲤鱼王准备好跳了！我的暴鲤龙准备好咬人了！","Flop...":"啪嗒……","All the Magikarp in the lake turned into Gyarados overnight. It is not natural.":"湖里所有的鲤鱼王一夜之间都变成了暴鲤龙。这太不正常了。","I am camping by the lake to see the red Gyarados. Battle me while I wait!":"我在湖边露营，等着看红色暴鲤龙。等的时候陪我对战吧！","Rolled up and lost...":"缩成一团输掉了……","At night the lake is so quiet. Then suddenly: splash! A Gyarados!":"晚上的湖好安静。然后突然——哗啦！一只暴鲤龙！","Tiffany":"蒂芙尼","A picnic by the lake! And a battle for dessert!":"在湖边野餐！再来一场对战当甜点！","Dessert is over...":"甜点吃完了……","Clefairy love the moonlight over the lake. It is so pretty.":"皮皮最喜欢湖面上的月光了。好美啊。","The lake has been full of angry Gyarados for a week. There is a red one out in the middle!":"这一个星期湖里全是暴躁的暴鲤龙。湖中间还有一只红色的！","I will keep the guards here busy. Go on down the stairs!":"这里的守卫交给我。你快下楼去！","An intruder! How did you get past the shop?":"有入侵者！你是怎么通过那家店的？","Ugh, I let you in...":"呜，居然让你进来了……","The boss is going to be so mad at me.":"老大一定会大发雷霆的。","Our radio is making all the Magikarp evolve. Isn't it brilliant?":"我们的电波正在让所有鲤鱼王进化。是不是很厉害？","Not so brilliant after all...":"看来也没那么厉害……","We were going to sell all those Gyarados. Ruined!":"我们本来打算把那些暴鲤龙全卖掉的。全泡汤了！","Team Rocket is back, and Johto is ours! Get out of here!":"火箭队回来了，城都是我们的！快滚出去！","Johto is not ours yet...":"城都还不是我们的……","Our executive is downstairs. He will deal with you.":"我们的干部在楼下。他会收拾你的。","Nobody gets into the machine room without the executive's say-so!":"没有干部的允许，谁也不准进机房！","Petrel":"拉姆达","So you are the brat who keeps getting in our way. I am Petrel, an executive of Team Rocket. Our radio signal will not be switched off by a child!":"原来就是你这个小鬼一直在妨碍我们。我是火箭队干部拉姆达。我们的电波信号可不会被小孩子关掉！","Hmph. Not bad, kid.":"哼。还不赖嘛，小鬼。","Rosalind":"罗莎琳","You made it across the ice? Then let us see how you do against a Skier!":"你成功滑过冰面了？那就看看你对上滑雪者会怎样吧！","I slipped...":"我滑倒了……","Pryce never slips on the ice. Not once in fifty years.":"柳伯在冰上从来不会滑倒。五十年来一次都没有。","Clarissa":"克拉莉莎","The cold makes my Dewgong stronger. Are you freezing yet?":"寒冷让我的白海狮变得更强。你冻僵了吗？","I am the one who is frozen...":"冻僵的是我……","Fire, Fighting, Rock and Steel moves melt Ice types.":"火、格斗、岩石和钢属性的招式能融化冰属性。","I board on the ice every day. Ready to wipe out?":"我每天都在冰上滑板。准备好摔跤了吗？","Wiped out...":"摔了个四脚朝天……","On ice you keep sliding until something stops you. Use the rocks!":"在冰上会一直滑到撞上东西为止。好好利用岩石吧！","Brad":"布拉德","Swinub dig in the snow for food. And they dig into opponents too!":"小山猪会在雪里挖东西吃。它们也会去挖对手！","Buried in the snow...":"被埋在雪里了……","Pryce's Piloswine is huge. Its tusks can break ice.":"柳伯的长毛猪好巨大。它的獠牙能打碎冰块。","Fifty winters I have trained with Ice Pokémon, and every one of them taught me something. I am Pryce. Let us see whether you can endure the cold!":"我与冰属性宝可梦一同修行了五十个冬天，每一个冬天都教会了我一些东西。我是柳伯。让我看看你能不能忍受这份寒冷吧！","Hm... You are stronger than the winter wind. A heart like yours will see you through any hardship.":"嗯……你比冬天的寒风还要强。有这样一颗心，你一定能克服任何困难。","Mahogany Town. Home of the ninja, it is said.":"卡吉镇。据说是忍者的故乡。","Mahogany Town Pokémon Gym. Leader: Pryce, the winter master who has trained for fifty years.":"卡吉镇宝可梦道馆。馆主：柳伯，修行了五十年的冬之大师。","Route 43. Mahogany Town to the south, the Lake of Rage to the north.":"43号道路。南边是卡吉镇，北边是愤怒之湖。","The Lake of Rage is just ahead. Mind the Gyarados!":"前方就是愤怒之湖。小心暴鲤龙！","The Lake of Rage. They say it was made by a Gyarados in a rage, long ago.":"愤怒之湖。据说是很久以前一只暴怒的暴鲤龙造成的。","Sorry, the road east is closed. A rockfall buried it, and we are still digging it out.":"抱歉，往东的路封闭了。落石把路埋住了，我们还在挖。","Men in black keep coming by and telling us to stop working. Who are they to give orders?":"老有穿黑衣服的人跑来叫我们别干了。他们凭什么发号施令？","East: Route 44, the Ice Path and Blackthorn City.":"东：44号道路、冰之洞、烟墨市。","I will stay in this mountain until I can beat you. Raise that Tyrogue well!":"我会留在这座山里，直到能打败你为止。好好培养那只无畏小子吧！","I have trained here for months... and still I lost. You are the real thing.":"我在这里修行了好几个月……结果还是输了。你是真正的高手。","Take this Pokémon. It is a Tyrogue: it can become a kicker, a puncher or a spinner, depending on how you raise it.":"收下这只宝可梦吧。这是无畏小子：看你怎么培养，它会成为踢腿高手、出拳高手或是旋转高手。","Tully":"阿杜","This pond is full of Goldeen. And so is my team!":"这个池塘里全是角金鱼。我的队伍也是！","The big one got away...":"大鱼跑掉了……","Fish bite best in the early morning. Remember that.":"清晨的时候鱼最容易上钩。记住了。","Shane":"阿夏","A Nidorina and a Nidorino! Aren't they a perfect pair?":"尼多娜和尼多力诺！是不是完美的一对？","My perfect pair...":"我完美的一对……","A Moon Stone makes them evolve. I have been saving up for one.":"用月之石就能让它们进化。我正在存钱买一颗。","Markus":"马库斯","I am studying the rocks of Mt. Mortar. My Slowpoke helps by... sitting.":"我在研究擂钵山的岩石。我的呆呆兽负责帮忙……坐着。","My research has been interrupted...":"我的研究被打断了……","This mountain is hollow inside. Some say it is an old volcano.":"这座山里面是空的。有人说它是一座古老的火山。","Benjamin":"阿本","Mountains are for climbing, and Trainers are for battling!":"山是用来爬的，训练家是用来对战的！","There is a man training alone in the depths of this mountain. He never comes out.":"这座山的深处有个人在独自修行。他从来不出来。","Kiyo":"阿清","Who dares to disturb my training? I am Kiyo, the Karate King! Show me your strength!":"是谁敢打扰我修行？我是空手道大王阿清！让我看看你的力量！","Waaargh! I am beaten!":"哇啊啊！我输了！","Route 42. Ecruteak City to the west, Mahogany Town to the east, through Mt. Mortar.":"42号道路。西边是圆朱市，穿过擂钵山，东边是卡吉镇。","Route 42. Mahogany Town is just to the east.":"42号道路。东边就是卡吉镇。","Oh! You must be {player}, the Champion from Kanto! Professor Oak told me all about you. I am Professor Elm.":"哦！你一定就是{player}吧，关都的冠军！大木博士跟我说了你好多事。我是空木博士。","I study how Pokémon evolve, and how they hatch from Eggs. Johto is full of things to discover!":"我在研究宝可梦怎么进化，还有它们怎么从蛋里孵出来。城都到处都是值得探索的东西！","One thing you should know: here in Johto, a Pokémon only follows a Trainer it respects. And respect is earned with Johto's Gym badges.":"有件事你得知道：在城都，宝可梦只会听从它尊敬的训练家。而尊敬要靠城都道馆的徽章来赢得。","Your Pokémon from Kanto are very strong, so they may ignore your orders until you earn badges here. Each badge makes more of them listen.":"你从关都带来的宝可梦都很强，所以在你拿到这里的徽章之前，它们可能不听你的指挥。每拿到一枚徽章，就会有更多宝可梦听你的。","So why not start fresh? I would like you to raise one of my Pokémon. They are in the Poké Balls on the machine.":"那何不从头开始呢？我想请你培养我的一只宝可梦。它们就在机器上的精灵球里。","Go on, choose one of the three Pokémon on the machine!":"来吧，从机器上的三只宝可梦里选一只吧！","Mr. Pokémon lives north of Cherrygrove City, at the end of Route 30. He said he found something amazing!":"宝可梦爷爷住在吉花市北边，30号道路的尽头。他说他发现了很了不起的东西！","{player}! While you were away, someone broke in and stole one of my Pokémon! The police are searching for him.":"{player}！你不在的时候，有人闯进来偷走了我的一只宝可梦！警察正在找他。","Please, tell the officer everything you saw!":"拜托你，把你看到的都告诉警察吧！","So this is what Mr. Pokémon found... A Pokémon Egg! Nobody knows how Eggs come to be. What a mystery!":"原来宝可梦爷爷发现的是这个……宝可梦的蛋！没人知道蛋是怎么来的。真是个谜啊！","Eggs hatch when they are kept warm and on the move. Would you carry it with you? Walk with it, and it should hatch before long.":"蛋要保持温暖、跟着走动才会孵化。你能带着它吗？带着它多走走，应该很快就会孵出来了。","And take these. You will want to catch Johto's Pokémon too.":"还有，这些给你。你一定也想抓城都的宝可梦吧。","The nearest Gym is in Violet City: west through Route 29 to Cherrygrove City, then north and west along Routes 30 and 31.":"最近的道馆在桔梗市：往西走29号道路到吉花市，再沿着30号和31号道路往北、往西走。","The Gym in Violet City is waiting. Remember: each badge makes your stronger Pokémon listen a little more.":"桔梗市的道馆在等着你。记住：每拿到一枚徽章，你那些强大的宝可梦就会更听话一点。","Those are Professor Elm's Pokémon. Better ask him first.":"那些是空木博士的宝可梦。还是先问问他吧。","Professor Elm's Pokémon is resting in this Poké Ball.":"这个精灵球里，空木博士的宝可梦正在休息。","Wonderful! I think it likes you already.":"太好了！我看它已经喜欢上你了。","{player} received {mon} from Prof. Elm!":"{player}从空木博士那里得到了{mon}！","Your party was full, so {mon} went to your PC. Use the PC here to swap your team.":"你的队伍满了，所以{mon}被送到了你的电脑里。用这里的电脑调整队伍吧。","Now, I have a favour to ask. My friend Mr. Pokémon says he found something amazing. He lives north of Cherrygrove City, on Route 30.":"对了，我想拜托你一件事。我的朋友宝可梦爷爷说他发现了很了不起的东西。他住在吉花市北边的30号道路上。","Would you go and see what it is? Your new partner will grow strong on the way!":"你能去看看是什么吗？你的新伙伴在路上也会变强的！","Police! A Pokémon was stolen from this lab. You there, did you see anything?":"我是警察！这间研究所有宝可梦被偷了。你，有没有看到什么？","A red-haired boy battled you with it in Cherrygrove? Did he say his name?":"一个红头发的男孩在吉花市用它跟你对战了？他有说他叫什么名字吗？","{rival2}, you say? Thank you. We will find him!":"你说他叫{rival2}？谢谢你。我们一定会找到他！","Thank you, {player}. At least the Pokémon is with a Trainer... I hope he treats it well.":"谢谢你，{player}。至少那只宝可梦跟着一位训练家……希望他会好好对待它。","Huh? The Mystery Egg is moving!":"咦？神奇蛋在动！","Travelers between Kanto and Johto often stop here. Your Pokémon look tired. Let them rest a while.":"往来关都和城都的旅人常在这里歇脚。你的宝可梦看起来累了，让它们休息一下吧。","There! Good as new. Safe travels!":"好了！完全恢复了。一路顺风！","Your Pokémon look tired. Let me use the lab's machine on them.":"你的宝可梦看起来累了。我用研究所的机器帮它们恢复一下吧。","All better! Come back any time.":"都恢复好了！随时再来吧。","...What are you looking at? This is Professor Elm's lab. They say he keeps rare Pokémon in there. ...Get lost.":"……看什么看？这是空木博士的研究所。听说他在里面养着稀有的宝可梦。……走开。","Professor Elm studies how Pokémon evolve. Pokémon from Kanto look a little different to him, I bet!":"空木博士研究宝可梦的进化。我猜在他眼里，关都的宝可梦有点不一样吧！","West of town is Route 29. At night, different Pokémon come out in the grass. Hoothoot, for one!":"镇子西边是29号道路。到了晚上，草丛里会出现不一样的宝可梦。比如咕咕！","My husband forgets to eat when he is working. If you see him, tell him dinner is ready!":"我丈夫一工作起来就忘了吃饭。你要是看到他，跟他说晚饭做好了！","When I grow up, I want to help my dad with his research. Or be a Champion like you!":"我长大以后想帮爸爸做研究。或者像你一样当冠军！","In Johto, morning, day and night each have their own Pokémon. Check your grass at every hour!":"在城都，早上、白天和晚上各有不同的宝可梦。每个时段都去草丛看看吧！","Sentret runs around here by day, and Hoothoot comes out at night. Same grass, different Pokémon!":"白天这里有尾立跑来跑去，晚上就换咕咕出来。同样的草丛，不同的宝可梦！","Prof. Elm":"空木博士","Officer":"警察","Route 26. North: the Pokémon League. South and then west: Route 27 and New Bark Town in Johto.":"26号道路。北：宝可梦联盟。往南再往西：27号道路和城都的若叶镇。","Route 27. West: New Bark Town, the first town of Johto.":"27号道路。西：若叶镇，城都的第一个城镇。","New Bark Town. A fresh wind for every new start.":"若叶镇。为每一个新的开始吹来清新的风。","Research notes: \"Some Pokémon evolve when they come to trust their Trainer...\"":"研究笔记：“有些宝可梦在信任自己的训练家之后就会进化……”","Route 29. West: Cherrygrove City. East: New Bark Town.":"29号道路。西：吉花市。东：若叶镇。","{player}! All eight of Johto's badges! I knew you could do it!":"{player}！城都的八枚徽章全到手了！我就知道你能行！","This is for you. It is the Master Ball, the finest Poké Ball there is: it catches any wild Pokémon without fail.":"这个送给你。这是大师球，世界上最好的精灵球：任何野生宝可梦都能百分之百抓到。","Oh, and the officer called. The boy who stole my Pokémon was seen heading for Victory Road. He seems to have changed...":"对了，警察打电话来了。有人看到偷走我宝可梦的那个少年往冠军之路去了。他好像变了……","The Pokémon League is beyond Victory Road: east across Route 27, then north on Route 26. Good luck, {player}!":"宝可梦联盟就在冠军之路的另一头：先往东穿过27号道路，再沿26号道路往北。祝你好运，{player}！","Victory Road leads to the Pokémon League. Trainers from Johto may only go on once they hold all eight of Johto's badges.":"冠军之路通往宝可梦联盟。城都的训练家要集齐城都的八枚徽章才能通过。","All eight Johto badges! Victory Road is open to you. The Pokémon League waits at the other end.":"城都的八枚徽章！冠军之路为你开放了。宝可梦联盟就在另一头等着你。","A great waterfall pours down from the cliffs. With Waterfall and the Rising Badge, a Pokémon could climb it.":"一道大瀑布从悬崖上倾泻而下。有了攀瀑和升龙徽章，宝可梦就能爬上去。","There you are, {player}! I heard about the Ruins of Alph. Pokémon shaped like letters... the world is full of mysteries!":"你来了，{player}！我听说阿露福遗迹的事了。形状像文字的宝可梦……这个世界真是充满了谜团！","I have a mystery of my own. Remember the Egg Mr. Pokémon found? Since then, the Day Care on Route 34 has been finding Eggs in its yard!":"我也有一个谜要解。还记得宝可梦爷爷找到的那颗蛋吗？从那以后，34号道路的培育屋在院子里发现了好几颗蛋！","They say an Egg sometimes turns up when two Pokémon there get along. Would you find out for me? Hatch an Egg from the Day Care, and show me what comes out!":"听说两只宝可梦在那里处得好的话，有时就会出现蛋。你能帮我查个明白吗？孵一颗培育屋的蛋，让我看看会孵出什么！","The Day Care is on Route 34, just south of Goldenrod City. Hatch an Egg from there and bring me the Pokémon!":"培育屋在34号道路，就在满金市南边。孵一颗那里的蛋，把宝可梦带来给我看！","You hatched an Egg from the Day Care? Let me see...":"你孵出了培育屋的蛋？让我看看……","A Pokémon at the very first stage of its family, only just born! So Pokémon really do come from Eggs, and parents pass things on to their young.":"是这一族最初阶段的宝可梦，才刚出生！原来宝可梦真的是从蛋里出生的，而且父母会把一些东西传给孩子。","Thank you, {player}. This is a big step for my research. Keep leaving Pokémon at the Day Care: who knows what will hatch next!":"谢谢你，{player}。这对我的研究是一大进展。继续把宝可梦寄放在培育屋吧：谁知道下次会孵出什么呢！","Mr. Pokémon called. He heard about your Egg, and he would like to show you something from his collection. His house is at the end of Route 30.":"宝可梦爷爷打来电话了。他听说了你那颗蛋的事，想给你看看他收藏的东西。他家在30号道路的尽头。","That is... the Secret Potion from Cianwood! Please, give it to Amphy.":"那是……湛蓝市的秘传之药！拜托了，给亮亮吃吧。","{player} gave the Secret Potion to Amphy.":"{player}把秘传之药给亮亮吃了。","Pa... Pa-paloo!":"帕……帕帕噜！","Amphy! Your light is back! Thank you so much. I could not leave it alone, not even for a moment.":"亮亮！你的光回来了！真的太谢谢你了。我一刻也不能离开它身边。","I must go back to my Gym now. Come and challenge me there. I will be waiting.":"我现在得回道馆了。来道馆挑战我吧。我会等你的。","...This is Amphy. It lights the sea at night, so the ships do not get lost.":"……这是亮亮。它在夜里照亮大海，让船只不会迷路。","But Amphy fell ill, and its light is fading. I cannot leave its side.":"可是亮亮生病了，它的光越来越弱。我不能离开它。","They say the pharmacy in Cianwood City, across the sea, makes a medicine that cures anything. Would you... bring it here for me?":"听说大海对面的湛蓝市药店，有一种什么病都能治好的药。你能……帮我带来吗？","Amphy and I will keep the light shining. Please come back to Olivine any time.":"我和亮亮会一直守护这盏灯。欢迎你随时回浅葱市来。","The Gym is empty. A sign on the door reads: \"Jasmine is at the Lighthouse, caring for a sick Pokémon.\"":"道馆里没有人。门上的告示写着：“阿蜜在灯塔照顾生病的宝可梦。”","Yo, Champion! Jasmine uses Steel types. They resist almost everything: hit them with Fire, Fighting or Ground moves.":"哟，冠军！阿蜜用的是钢属性的宝可梦。它们几乎什么都能抵挡：用火、格斗或地面属性的招式攻击吧。","Her Magnemite are part Electric, so Ground moves are double trouble for them. Her Steelix is huge, but slow.":"她的小磁怪还有电属性，所以地面属性的招式对它们格外有效。她的大钢蛇很庞大，但动作很慢。","With five Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 50 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 60!":"有五枚城都徽章，50级以下的宝可梦会听你的。在这里赢了，就能提高到60级！","This is the Mineral Badge. You have earned it.":"这是钢铁徽章。这是你应得的。","{player} received the Mineral Badge from Jasmine!":"{player}从阿蜜那里得到了钢铁徽章！","With the Mineral Badge, Pokémon up to level 60 will listen to you.":"有了钢铁徽章，60级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话。","And this, too: TM23, Iron Tail. A tail as hard as steel. It may even lower the target's Defence.":"这个也给你：招式学习器23，铁尾。像钢铁一样坚硬的尾巴，有时还能降低对手的防御。","The sea west of here leads to Cianwood City. You will need a Pokémon that can Surf.":"从这里往西的海通往湛蓝市。你需要一只会冲浪的宝可梦。","Jasmine, our Gym Leader, has not left the Lighthouse for days. Her Pokémon up there is sick.":"我们的道馆馆主阿蜜已经好几天没离开灯塔了。她在上面的宝可梦生病了。","The Lighthouse is shining again! Jasmine is back at her Gym.":"灯塔又亮起来了！阿蜜回道馆了。","Moomoo Milk from the farm up north is sold at the café. It is delicious!":"咖啡馆有卖北边牧场的哞哞鲜奶。超好喝的！","Cianwood City is across the sea to the west. People say a Pokémon that runs on water was seen there!":"湛蓝市在西边的大海对面。听说有人在那里看到了在水面上奔跑的宝可梦！","Steel types resist almost everything. Fire, Fighting and Ground moves get through, though.":"钢属性几乎能抵挡一切。不过火、格斗和地面属性的招式还是有效的。","When I was young, I pushed boulders around with Strength to train. They say the Gym in Cianwood is full of rocks like that.":"我年轻的时候，用怪力推大石头来锻炼。听说湛蓝市的道馆里到处都是那种石头。","Welcome to the Olivine Café! Our Moomoo Milk comes fresh from the farm on Route 39.":"欢迎光临浅葱咖啡馆！我们的哞哞鲜奶是从39号道路的牧场新鲜送来的。","The Lighthouse has guided ships for a hundred years. Its light is not a lamp: it is a Pokémon that shines.":"灯塔已经为船只引路一百年了。它的光不是灯，而是一只会发光的宝可梦。","Jasmine is so kind. She is shy, but when she battles, she is as hard as steel!":"阿蜜好温柔。她很害羞，但对战的时候可是像钢铁一样坚强！","My husband is a sailor on the S.S. Aqua. When it is fixed, it will sail to Vermilion City in Kanto.":"我丈夫是S.S.水神号上的水手。等船修好了，就会开往关都的枯叶市。","Huey":"阿休","This Lighthouse is a sailor's best friend. Do not you dare disturb it!":"这座灯塔是水手最好的朋友。不准你来捣乱！","I was only guarding it...":"我只是在守护它而已……","Without the light up top, ships could hit the rocks at night.":"要是顶上没有光，船只晚上就可能撞上礁石。","Alfred":"阿弗","Noctowl sees in the dark as well as you see in daylight. Shall we?":"猫头夜鹰在黑暗中看得跟你白天一样清楚。开始吧？","I did not see that coming, even so.":"即便如此，我还是没看出来。","Jasmine is at the very top, with the Pokémon that lights the sea.":"阿蜜在最顶层，陪着照亮大海的宝可梦。","I came to see the light Pokémon, but it is sick... Let us battle to cheer up!":"我是来看那只会发光的宝可梦的，可它生病了……来对战打起精神吧！","Not very cheerful...":"一点都没打起精神……","Marill's tail floats like a ball. It never sinks in the water.":"玛力露的尾巴像球一样会浮起来。它在水里从来不会沉下去。","My Kingler's claw can crush rocks! Ready?":"我的巨钳蟹的钳子能夹碎岩石！准备好了吗？","Pinched back...":"反被夹了……","A sick light means a dark sea. Every sailor in Olivine is worried.":"灯光病了，大海就是一片漆黑。浅葱市的水手都很担心。","Amphy, the Ampharos, is breathing weakly. The light on its tail has almost gone out.":"电龙亮亮呼吸很微弱。它尾巴上的光几乎要熄灭了。","Pa-paloo! Amphy's tail shines brightly over the sea.":"帕帕噜！亮亮的尾巴在海面上闪闪发光。","Thank you again for saving Amphy. But in here, I am a Gym Leader. I use Steel-type Pokémon. They are hard and cold... but strong. Shall we begin?":"再次谢谢你救了亮亮。不过在这里，我是道馆馆主。我用的是钢属性宝可梦。它们又硬又冷……但很强。我们开始吧？","...Well done. You are as strong as steel yourself.":"……你做得很好。你本身就像钢铁一样坚强。","Amphy":"亮亮","Olivine City. A port town that smells of the sea breeze.":"浅葱市。飘着海风气息的港口城市。","Olivine Lighthouse. Its light guides the ships at night.":"浅葱灯塔。它的光在夜里为船只引路。","Olivine City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Jasmine, the girl of steel and gentle heart.":"浅葱市宝可梦道馆。馆主：阿蜜，钢铁般坚强又心地温柔的女孩。","Olivine Port. The S.S. Aqua is in the dock for repairs. Sailings will resume soon.":"浅葱港。S.S.水神号正在船坞维修，不久就会恢复航行。","Olivine Port. The S.S. Aqua sails south from here to the Hoenn region.":"浅葱港。S.S.水神号从这里向南开往丰缘地区。","Welcome to the National Park! Today we are holding the Bug-Catching Contest.":"欢迎来到自然公园！今天这里举办捕虫大赛。","Today's contest is over. Come back tomorrow!":"今天的大赛已经结束了。明天再来吧！","You need a Pokémon that can battle to take part.":"要参加的话，需要一只能战斗的宝可梦。","Would you like to take part?":"要参加吗？","Maybe next time, then!":"那就下次吧！","Only your first Pokémon may come with you: {mon}. The others will wait here.":"只有你队伍里的第一只宝可梦可以参加：{mon}。其他的就在这里等你吧。","Take these: {ball} ×{n}. You have {s} steps to catch the best Bug Pokémon you can!":"这些给你：{ball}×{n}。你有{s}步的时间，去抓一只最棒的虫宝可梦吧！","Ready? Go!":"准备好了吗？开始！","{mon} is your entry for the contest!":"{mon}就是你参赛的宝可梦了！","You already have {old}. Keep {mon} instead?":"你已经有{old}了。要换成{mon}吗？","{mon} is your entry now. {old} went back into the grass.":"现在你参赛的是{mon}了。{old}回到草丛里去了。","{mon} went back into the grass.":"{mon}回到草丛里去了。","The contest is over! The judges are looking at the Pokémon everyone caught...":"大赛结束！评审们正在查看大家抓到的宝可梦……","Bug Catcher Don":"捕虫少年 阿东","Camper Ed":"露营男 阿德","Picnicker Cindy":"野餐女 欣蒂","Third place: {name}, with {mon}! {n} points.":"第三名：{name}，参赛宝可梦是{mon}！{n}分。","Second place: {name}, with {mon}! {n} points.":"第二名：{name}，参赛宝可梦是{mon}！{n}分。","And the winner is... {name}, with {mon}! {n} points!":"冠军是……{name}，参赛宝可梦是{mon}！{n}分！","You did not catch anything this time. Better luck next time!":"这次你什么都没抓到。下次加油吧！","Congratulations! You came in place {n}. Here is your prize.":"恭喜！你得了第{n}名。这是你的奖品。","You came in place {n}. Thank you for taking part! Here is a little something.":"你得了第{n}名。谢谢你的参与！这是一点小心意。","And the {mon} you caught is yours to keep!":"你抓到的{mon}就归你了！","Do you want to end the contest now?":"要现在结束比赛吗？","Good luck! Catch a big one!":"加油！抓一只大的吧！","Time is up! The contest is over.":"时间到！大赛结束了。","You have no Sport Balls left! The contest is over for you.":"你的竞赛球用完了！你的比赛结束了。","Your Pokémon cannot battle any more. The contest is over for you.":"你的宝可梦已经无法战斗了。你的比赛结束了。","I dug a hole to sleep in last night. Now I am wide awake. Battle!":"昨晚我挖了个洞睡觉。现在我精神百倍。对战吧！","Back into my hole I go...":"我还是回洞里去吧……","Diglett pop out of the ground anywhere. You never know where.":"地鼠会从地面的任何地方冒出来。你永远不知道它会从哪里出来。","Brooke":"布露克","My Pikachu is full of energy today. Let's see how much!":"我的皮卡丘今天精力充沛。来看看有多充沛吧！","All that energy, gone in a flash...":"那么多的电力，一下子就没了……","Pikachu stores electricity in its cheeks. Do not pinch them!":"皮卡丘把电储存在脸颊里。可别去捏哦！","Vulpix's tails are so soft. Its fire is not, though!":"六尾的尾巴好柔软。但它的火可一点都不温柔！","My Vulpix's fire went out...":"我的六尾的火熄灭了……","Vulpix grows more tails as it gets older. Six of them!":"六尾长大后尾巴会越来越多。一共六条！","Bryan":"布莱恩","My birds fly faster than the wind. Try and keep up!":"我的鸟比风还快。有本事就跟上吧！","My birds came down to earth...":"我的鸟都落地了……","Pidgey flocks fly over the National Park at dawn. It is a beautiful sight.":"黎明时分，成群的波波会飞过自然公园。景色非常美。","I am training for the Bug-Catching Contest. You can be my practice!":"我在为捕虫大赛做训练。就拿你来练练手吧！","I need more practice...":"我还得多练习……","In the contest, a high-level Pokémon with lots of HP left scores best. A rare one too!":"比赛中，等级高、剩余HP多的宝可梦得分最高。稀有的也一样！","I come here every day to play with my Pokémon. The grass is so soft!":"我每天都来这里和宝可梦一起玩。草地好软啊！","Scyther and Pinsir are the stars of the contest. Catch one, and you are sure to win!":"飞天螳螂和凯罗斯是大赛的明星。抓到一只的话，肯定能赢！","East of here, Route 36 runs to Violet City. They say a tree on that road moves by itself!":"从这里往东，36号道路通往桔梗市。听说那条路上有棵树会自己动！","Bug Pokémon are easier to catch when they are weak. But a Pokémon with more HP left scores more in the contest!":"虫宝可梦虚弱的时候比较好抓。不过在大赛里，剩余HP越多，得分越高哦！","Route 35. Goldenrod City to the south, the National Park to the north.":"35号道路。南边是满金市，北边是自然公园。","The National Park is just ahead. The Bug-Catching Contest is held there every day!":"前方就是自然公园。那里每天都会举办捕虫大赛！","The National Park. A place for people and Pokémon to relax. Please keep it clean!":"自然公园。人与宝可梦放松身心的地方。请保持清洁！","The fountain is fed by a spring deep under the park.":"喷泉的水来自公园地下深处的泉水。","The Bug-Catching Contest is on! Catch the best Bug Pokémon you can.":"捕虫大赛进行中！尽量抓一只最棒的虫宝可梦吧。","...You. I heard Team Rocket took the Radio Tower. Pathetic, hiding in a crowd like that.":"……是你。听说火箭队占领了广播塔。成群结队躲在一起，真可悲。","I lost to a Dragon Trainer called Lance. He said I do not care about my Pokémon. What would he know?":"我输给了一个叫阿渡的龙使。他说我不在乎自己的宝可梦。他懂什么？","I will prove I am strong. Starting with you!":"我会证明我很强。就从你开始！","...Why? I keep getting stronger, and still... Never mind. I do not need your pity.":"……为什么？我明明一直在变强，却还是……算了。我不需要你的同情。","You came to save me? Thank you! Team Rocket tied me up down here and took over my tower.":"你是来救我的吗？谢谢你！火箭队把我绑在这里，占领了我的广播塔。","The impostor upstairs is wearing my clothes. Disgraceful! Listen: the stairs on the third floor are locked with a code. Here it is.":"楼上那个冒牌货竟然穿着我的衣服。太不像话了！听好：三楼的楼梯用密码锁住了。密码是这个。","{player} learned the code of the stairs!":"{player}记住了楼梯的密码！","Their leaders are on the top floors. Please, take my tower back!":"他们的头目在最上面几层。拜托了，把我的广播塔夺回来！","Our radio is back on the air, all thanks to you. Tune in any time!":"多亏了你，我们的电台恢复播放了。欢迎随时收听！","You did it! Team Rocket is gone, and the Radio Tower is ours again. Thank you!":"你成功了！火箭队走了，广播塔又回到我们手里了。谢谢你！","Please, take this. A radio tower runs on electricity, so this seems fitting: TM24, Thunderbolt.":"请收下这个。广播塔靠电力运作，所以这个最合适：招式学习器24，十万伏特。","We could not even do this much in Giovanni's absence... Team Rocket is finished. I declare it disbanded!":"坂木大人不在，我们连这点事都办不到……火箭队完了。我宣布火箭队解散！","Herbs! Bitter, but they work. Well... I sell potions too.":"草药！虽然苦，但是有效。呃……我也卖伤药啦。","Your radio crackles... and a voice breaks in:":"你的收音机发出沙沙声……一个声音插了进来：","\"Attention, Johto! This is Team Rocket! We have taken over the Radio Tower in Goldenrod City!\"":"“城都的各位请注意！这里是火箭队！我们已经占领了满金市的广播塔！”","\"Giovanni! Wherever you are, if you can hear us, come back! Team Rocket is waiting for you!\"":"“坂木大人！无论您在哪里，如果听得到，请回来吧！火箭队在等着您！”","The broadcast ends in a burst of static.":"广播在一阵杂音中结束了。","The stairs are blocked by a locked door. It needs a code to open.":"楼梯被一扇上锁的门挡住了。需要密码才能打开。","Fine, take it! The real Director is locked in the warehouse under the Underground. Not that it matters!":"好吧，拿去！真正的台长被关在地下通道下面的仓库里。反正也无所谓了！","The door to the warehouse is locked. It needs a key.":"仓库的门锁着。需要钥匙才能打开。","This is the music studio. Thanks to you, we are back on the air!":"这里是音乐录音室。多亏了你，我们又能播放了！","This studio is ours! From now on, the radio plays only Team Rocket!":"这个录音室是我们的了！从现在起，电台只播火箭队！","Off the air...":"停播了……","The Director is on the floor above. He works for us now. Ha!":"台长在楼上。他现在为我们工作了。哈！","You again? How many times do we have to tell you to go away?":"又是你？到底要我们说几次你才肯走？","Many more times, it seems...":"看来还要说很多次……","When Giovanni hears our broadcast, he will come back to lead us!":"等坂木大人听到我们的广播，他就会回来领导我们！","The Pokémon Talk show is recorded on this floor. Our guest today is Professor Oak!":"宝可梦访谈节目就在这一层录制。今天的嘉宾是大木博士！","Nobody gets near the Director! He is very busy... being our Director.":"谁也不准靠近台长！他很忙……忙着当我们的台长。","Okay, you can get near him...":"好吧，你可以靠近他了……","The Director up there is a little odd today. Don't ask why.":"楼上的台长今天有点怪。别问为什么。","Ah, a visitor! I am the Director of the Radio Tower... Ha! Fooled you! It is me, Petrel, in disguise! The real Director is locked away!":"啊，有客人！我是广播塔的台长……哈！被骗了吧！是我，乔装的拉姆达！真正的台长被关起来了！","Gah! My disguise did not help at all!":"啊！我的乔装一点用都没有！","I host the Lucky Number show. Today's lucky number is... the number of Rockets you beat!":"我主持幸运号码节目。今天的幸运号码就是……你打败的火箭队人数！","Our executive is right behind me. You will not get past!":"我们的干部就在我身后。你别想过去！","You got past...":"被你过去了……","Ariana is the toughest of us. Well, almost.":"雅典娜是我们之中最厉害的。呃，差不多吧。","Ariana":"雅典娜","So you are the child who keeps ruining our plans. I am Ariana, an executive of Team Rocket. You will regret coming here!":"原来你就是一直破坏我们计划的小孩。我是火箭队干部雅典娜。你会后悔来这里的！","How... how could I lose to you?":"怎么……我怎么会输给你？","Archer is waiting at the top. He will not be as kind as I was.":"阿波罗在最上面等着。他可不会像我这么手下留情。","Archer":"阿波罗","You have come this far... I am Archer. While Giovanni is away, I lead Team Rocket. We will call him back, and you will not stop us!":"你竟然来到了这里……我是阿波罗。坂木大人不在的时候，由我来带领火箭队。我们一定会让他回来，你阻止不了我们！","I... lost. Forgive me, Giovanni.":"我……输了。坂木大人，请原谅我。","The Underground runs beneath the whole city. There are shops down there, and a warehouse at the far end.":"地下通道贯穿整座城市。下面有商店，最里面还有一个仓库。","That door at the end leads to a warehouse. It has been locked since men in black moved in.":"尽头那扇门通往仓库。自从穿黑衣服的人搬进去后就一直锁着。","This tunnel is closed! Team Rocket business!":"这条通道封闭了！火箭队办事！","Closed for... repairs.":"封闭……维修中。","You need a key for the warehouse anyway. And only our executive has it.":"反正进仓库需要钥匙，而且只有我们的干部才有。","I will wait here until the tower is safe. Please, hurry!":"我会在这里等到广播塔安全为止。拜托你快一点！","How did you get the key? Did that fool Petrel lose it?":"你怎么拿到钥匙的？是拉姆达那个笨蛋弄丢的吗？","He definitely lost it...":"他肯定是弄丢了……","We were storing all the stolen things down here.":"我们把偷来的东西都藏在这下面。","The Director stays here until Giovanni comes back! Go away!":"坂木大人回来之前，台长都得待在这里！快走开！","Giovanni is not coming back, is he...":"坂木大人不会回来了，对吧……","Fine, talk to the old man. See if I care.":"好吧，去跟那老头说话吧。我才不在乎。","Director":"台长","South of here is Union Cave. On the other side is Azalea Town, where Slowpoke laze around everywhere.":"往南是互连洞。穿过去就是桧皮镇，那里到处都是懒洋洋的呆呆兽。","Albert":"阿博","I caught my Zubat in the cave down south. Want to see how strong it got?":"我的超音蝠是在南边的洞穴里抓到的。想看看它变得多强了吗？","Zubat, come back! You were too fast for us...":"超音蝠，回来！你太快了，我们跟不上……","Union Cave is dark and full of Zubat. Keep a Repel handy.":"互连洞又黑又满是超音蝠。随身带着除虫喷雾吧。","Ralph":"阿夫","Shh! You will scare the fish. ...Fine, then we battle!":"嘘！你会把鱼吓跑的。……好吧，那就来对战！","My line snapped...":"我的鱼线断了……","The best fishing is early in the morning. Or late at night. Or any time, really!":"钓鱼最好是在清晨。或者深夜。其实什么时候都行！","A picnic and a battle: my favourite kind of day!":"野餐加对战：我最喜欢这样的日子了！","Oh well. Back to my sandwiches.":"算了，回去吃我的三明治吧。","Nidoran love the grass on this route.":"尼多兰和尼多朗都很喜欢这条道路上的草丛。","Henry":"阿亨","I fish all day and battle all night. Here we go!":"我白天钓鱼，晚上对战。来吧！","Reeled in and released...":"钓上来又被放走了……","Poliwag swim up the streams from the sea.":"蚊香蝌蚪会从海里沿着小溪游上来。","I have been camping out here for a week. Let us battle!":"我已经在这里露营一个星期了。来对战吧！","Time to pack up my tent...":"该收帐篷了……","I sleep under the stars every night. The Hoothoot keep me company.":"我每晚都睡在星空下，有咕咕陪着我。","Peter":"小彼","My birds will fly circles around you!":"我的鸟会绕着你飞得团团转！","Every bird lover in Johto dreams of training at Falkner's Gym.":"城都所有喜欢鸟的人，都梦想着在阿速的道馆修行。","Union Cave goes right under the hills. Come out the other side and you are on Route 33.":"互连洞就在山丘下面穿过。从另一边出来就是33号道路。","Daniel":"阿丹","This cave is my second home. My Onix knows every tunnel!":"这个洞穴是我的第二个家。我的大岩蛇认得每一条隧道！","My Onix got lost...":"我的大岩蛇迷路了……","Union Cave links Route 32 with Route 33. Azalea Town is just beyond.":"互连洞连接着32号道路和33号道路。再过去就是桧皮镇。","Larry":"阿里","Have you heard? In Azalea, people love Slowpoke more than anything. Mine is the best one!":"你听说了吗？桧皮镇的人最爱呆呆兽了。我的呆呆兽是最棒的！","Slowpoke... you were too slow.":"呆呆兽……你太慢了。","They say a yawning Slowpoke brings rain to Azalea Town.":"据说呆呆兽打个哈欠，桧皮镇就会下雨。","Russell":"阿素","Rock Pokémon are like family. Meet the family!":"岩石宝可梦就像我的家人。来见见我的家人吧！","The whole family, beaten...":"全家都被打败了……","Geodude look just like rocks. Watch your step in here!":"小拳石看起来就像石头。在这里走路要小心！","Hiking builds strong legs, and strong Pokémon! Battle me!":"爬山能练出强壮的双腿，还有强壮的宝可梦！跟我对战吧！","My legs are tired...":"我的腿好累……","Azalea Town is just west of here. It is full of Slowpoke!":"桧皮镇就在这里的西边。那里到处都是呆呆兽！","Route 32. North: Violet City. South: Union Cave.":"32号道路。北：桔梗市。南：互连洞。","Union Cave. Through it lie Route 33 and Azalea Town.":"互连洞。穿过去就是33号道路和桧皮镇。","Route 33. West: Azalea Town. East: Union Cave.":"33号道路。西：桧皮镇。东：互连洞。","Oh, you only have one Pokémon with you. You will need it on the road!":"哎呀，你身边只有一只宝可梦。路上你还需要它呢！","Leave which Pokémon?":"要寄放哪只宝可梦？","If you leave that one, you will have no Pokémon able to battle!":"如果把它留下，你就没有能战斗的宝可梦了！","We will raise your {mon} for a while. Come back for it later.":"我们会帮你照顾{mon}一段时间。之后再来接它吧。","Lv. {lvl}":"Lv.{lvl}","Which one would you like back?":"你要领回哪一只？","Your {mon} has grown a lot. It went up by {n} levels!":"你的{mon}成长了很多。等级提升了{n}级！","Your {mon}? It has not grown much yet.":"你的{mon}吗？它还没怎么成长呢。","You owe us ₽{price}. Take it back?":"一共是₽{price}。要领回去吗？","You have no room for it in your party.":"你的队伍里没有空位了。","{player} took back {mon}.":"{player}领回了{mon}。","Come again!":"欢迎再来！","Hello, dear. My husband and I run the Day Care. We can raise your Pokémon for you.":"你好呀，孩子。我和老伴开了这家培育屋，可以帮你照顾宝可梦哦。","Leave one":"寄放","Take one back":"领回","My wife and I raise Pokémon in our yard. Talk to her inside if you want us to look after one.":"我和老伴在院子里养宝可梦。想让我们照顾的话，就进屋去跟她说吧。","Your {mon} is doing fine. It has been running all over the yard.":"你的{mon}很好哦。它在院子里到处跑来跑去呢。","Samuel":"阿森","I have been training on this road all day. Battle me!":"我在这条路上练了一整天了。来跟我对战吧！","All that training for nothing...":"练了这么久都白费了……","Goldenrod City is the biggest city in Johto. You could get lost in there!":"满金市是城都最大的城市。在那里可是会迷路的！","Ian":"伊恩","My Pokémon are fast and fierce. Ready?":"我的宝可梦又快又凶猛。准备好了吗？","Not fast enough...":"还是不够快……","I want to beat Whitney one day. Everyone says her Miltank is a monster.":"总有一天我要打败小茜。大家都说她的大奶罐是个怪物。","Gina":"吉娜","A picnic is more fun with a battle! Come on!":"野餐加上对战才更好玩！来吧！","My picnic blew away...":"我的野餐被风吹走了……","Hoppip float away on the wind if they do not hold on tight to something.":"毽子草如果不紧紧抓住什么东西，就会被风吹跑。","Todd":"阿托","Camping on Route 34 is great. Battling on Route 34 is even better!":"在34号道路露营很棒。在34号道路对战更棒！","I should go back to my tent...":"我还是回帐篷去吧……","Psyduck always has a headache. Maybe that is why it is so grumpy.":"可达鸭总是头痛。也许这就是它脾气这么差的原因吧。","My Snubbull is the cutest in all of Johto! Look how cute it is when it battles!":"我的布鲁是全城都最可爱的！看它对战的样子多可爱！","Even when it loses, it is so cute...":"就算输了，它还是好可爱……","Snubbull looks scary, but it is really a big softy. Just like me!":"布鲁看起来很凶，其实心肠可软了。就跟我一样！","Grandma and Grandpa raise Pokémon for Trainers. When they come back, they are much stronger!":"爷爷奶奶帮训练家照顾宝可梦。宝可梦回来的时候都变强了好多！","Route 34. Ilex Forest to the south, Goldenrod City to the north.":"34号道路。南边是栎树林，北边是满金市。","Route 34. Goldenrod City is just ahead.":"34号道路。前方就是满金市。","The Day Care. Let us raise your Pokémon for you!":"培育屋。让我们帮你培育宝可梦吧！","The two of them seem to get along very well.":"那两只看起来相处得非常好。","The two of them seem to get along.":"那两只看起来相处得还不错。","The two of them do not seem to like each other very much.":"那两只好像不太合得来。","The two of them would rather play with other Pokémon.":"那两只比较想和别的宝可梦玩。","Ah, a Trainer! Something odd happened: a few days ago we found an Egg in our yard, and nobody has come for it.":"啊，是训练家！发生了一件怪事：前几天我们在院子里捡到一颗蛋，一直没人来领。","Oh, but you are carrying six Eggs already! Hatch a few first, then come back.":"哎呀，你已经带着六颗蛋了！先孵出几颗再来吧。","Would you look after it? Keep it with you as you travel, and it will hatch.":"你能帮忙照顾它吗？旅行时一直带在身边，它就会孵化。","{player} received the Odd Egg!":"{player}得到了奇异的蛋！","If you leave two Pokémon that get along with my wife, they may leave an Egg of their own. Come and ask me now and then!":"如果你把两只合得来的宝可梦交给我老伴照顾，它们说不定也会留下一颗蛋。时不时来问问我吧！","Ah, there you are! We were looking after your Pokémon, and, my goodness, we found an Egg! Your Pokémon must have left it.":"啊，你来啦！我们照顾你的宝可梦的时候，哎呀，发现了一颗蛋！一定是你的宝可梦留下的。","Do you want the Egg?":"你要这颗蛋吗？","Then I will keep it for you for now.":"那我就先帮你保管着吧。","{player} received the Egg!":"{player}得到了蛋！","Keep it with you as you travel, and it will hatch.":"旅行时一直带在身边，它就会孵化。","A strange tree blocks the way. Water it with the Squirt Bottle?":"一棵奇怪的树挡住了去路。要用杰尼龟喷壶给它浇水吗？","{player} watered the strange tree with the Squirt Bottle.":"{player}用杰尼龟喷壶给奇怪的树浇了水。","The tree did not like that at all! It shook itself and attacked!":"那棵树一点都不喜欢这样！它抖了抖身体，扑了过来！","A strange tree blocks the way. When you touch it, it shivers... Is it really a tree?":"一棵奇怪的树挡住了去路。一碰它，它就抖了一下……这真的是树吗？","That tree up there... I am sure it moved when I looked away! And it is not even windy.":"上面那棵树……我刚一转头，它肯定动了！明明一点风都没有。","So the tree was a Pokémon all along! Sudowoodo hate water, I heard. Strange, for a tree.":"原来那棵树是宝可梦啊！听说树才怪讨厌水。作为一棵树还真奇怪。","I already know how this battle ends. Shall we find out if I am right?":"我早就知道这场对战的结局了。来看看我说得对不对吧？","I did not see that coming...":"这我可没预料到……","Psychic Pokémon read minds. Dark and Ghost moves are what they fear.":"超能力宝可梦能读懂人心。它们害怕的是恶属性和幽灵属性的招式。","Alan":"阿伦","Tangela is a mystery! Nobody has ever seen what is under all those vines. Battle!":"蔓藤怪是个谜！从来没人见过那堆藤蔓下面是什么。对战吧！","Still a mystery...":"还是个谜……","I like Pokémon that are hard to understand. Like that walking tree!":"我喜欢让人捉摸不透的宝可梦。比如那棵会走路的树！","Drowzee eats dreams. I wonder what yours taste like?":"催眠貘会吃掉梦。不知道你的梦是什么味道？","A bad dream...":"一场噩梦……","Ecruteak has two towers. One burned down long ago, and the other still stands.":"圆朱市有两座塔。一座很久以前烧毁了，另一座至今仍然矗立着。","Clefairy and Jigglypuff are best friends. Just like me and my sister!":"皮皮和胖丁是最好的朋友。就像我和我妹妹一样！","We lost together...":"我们一起输了……","My sister is in Ecruteak watching the Kimono Girls dance. I want to go too!":"我妹妹在圆朱市看舞子跳舞。我也想去！","Route 36. North: Route 37 and Ecruteak City.":"36号道路。北：37号道路和圆朱市。","The National Park is to the west.":"西边是自然公园。","Violet City is to the east.":"东边是桔梗市。","Ruins of Alph. Closed while the scientists study the ruins. Thank you for understanding.":"阿露福遗迹。学者们正在研究遗迹，暂停开放。感谢理解。","Route 37. Ecruteak City is just to the north.":"37号道路。北边就是圆朱市。","Sorry, the Ruins of Alph are closed. Since the last earthquake, we have been making sure the chambers are safe.":"抱歉，阿露福遗迹暂不开放。上次地震以后，我们一直在确认石室是否安全。","The Miltank looks weak. A healing Berry might give it its strength back.":"大奶罐看起来很虚弱。也许能回复体力的树果可以让它恢复精神。","The Miltank looks weak. Give it an {item}?":"大奶罐看起来很虚弱。要喂它{item}吗？","The Miltank ate the {item}. It looks a little better... and it wants more.":"大奶罐吃掉了{item}。看起来好一点了……它还想再吃。","The Miltank ate the {item}... Moooo! It jumped to its feet, full of energy!":"大奶罐吃掉了{item}……哞——！它一下子站了起来，精神百倍！","Our Miltank in the barn is sick. When a Miltank is weak, it needs lots of healing Berries.":"我们牛棚里的大奶罐生病了。大奶罐虚弱的时候，需要吃很多能回复体力的树果。","Berry trees grow along the roads around here. Would you help us out?":"附近的路边长着树果树。你愿意帮帮我们吗？","You fed our Miltank back to health! Thank you, young one. Take this as our thanks.":"你喂好了我们的大奶罐！谢谢你，年轻人。这个就当作谢礼吧。","That is TM44, Rest. The Pokémon sleeps and wakes up healed. Just like our Miltank, eh?":"那是招式学习器44，睡觉。宝可梦睡一觉醒来就恢复了。就跟我们的大奶罐一样，对吧？","Our Moomoo Milk is the best in Johto. Want some?":"我们的哞哞鲜奶是城都最好喝的。要来一点吗？","Toby":"阿托比","My Doduo have two heads, so they think twice as fast. Battle!":"我的嘟嘟有两个头，所以想事情快一倍。对战吧！","Both heads lost...":"两个头都输了……","Dodrio has three heads now. It argues with itself all day.":"嘟嘟利现在有三个头。它整天都在跟自己吵架。","I was on my way to buy Moomoo Milk. A battle first!":"我正要去买哞哞鲜奶。先来对战一场！","I think I need some milk now...":"我现在需要喝点牛奶了……","Moomoo Milk is the best drink for tired Pokémon. Everyone in Olivine buys it.":"哞哞鲜奶是给疲惫的宝可梦喝的最佳饮品。浅葱市的人都买它。","Mr. Mime can build invisible walls. Can you break through?":"魔墙人偶能筑起看不见的墙。你能突破吗？","The wall broke...":"墙被打破了……","Mr. Mime's walls are made of the air itself. I still do not understand how.":"魔墙人偶的墙是用空气做的。我到现在还搞不懂是怎么做到的。","Harry":"阿哈","I am on shore leave, but a sailor never stops battling!":"我正在上岸休假，但水手可是从不停止对战的！","Sunk on dry land...":"在陆地上沉没了……","My ship is docked in Olivine. The sea air there is the best.":"我的船停靠在浅葱市。那里的海风最舒服了。","Moo! The Miltank is chewing grass happily.":"哞！大奶罐正开心地嚼着草。","Moooo!":"哞——！","The Miltank looks at you sleepily.":"大奶罐睡眼惺忪地看着你。","Derek":"阿德瑞","Look at my Pikachu's little cheeks! Aren't they the cutest?":"看看我的皮卡丘的小脸颊！是不是可爱极了？","Even losing, it is so cute...":"就算输了也好可爱……","I came all the way here to show my Pikachu to the Miltank. They did not care.":"我特地跑来给大奶罐看我的皮卡丘。它们一点兴趣都没有。","Eugene":"阿尤金","Ahoy! A sailor's Pokémon are tough as old rope!":"喂！水手的宝可梦可是像老缆绳一样结实！","My rope snapped...":"我的缆绳断了……","At Olivine harbour, the ships come and go all day long.":"浅葱市的港口里，船只整天来来往往。","My Slowpoke is thinking very hard. About what, nobody knows.":"我的呆呆兽正在认真思考。至于想什么，谁也不知道。","Still thinking...":"还在想……","A Slowpoke bitten by a Shellder becomes a Slowbro. Lucky, or unlucky?":"呆呆兽被大舌贝咬住就会变成呆壳兽。这算幸运还是不幸呢？","Our Miltank give the richest milk in Johto. When one of them is sick, the whole farm worries.":"我们的大奶罐产的牛奶是城都最浓的。只要有一只生病，整个牧场都会担心。","Moo! The Miltank is full of energy again.":"哞！大奶罐又恢复了活力。","Our Miltank is sick and will not eat its grass. Grandpa says healing Berries would help, lots of them.":"我们的大奶罐生病了，连草都不吃。爷爷说要喂很多能回复体力的树果才行。","Look how well our Miltank is doing! Thank you for feeding it all those Berries.":"看我们的大奶罐多精神！谢谢你喂了它那么多树果。","Farmer":"牧场主人","Route 38. Ecruteak City is to the east.":"38号道路。东边是圆朱市。","Route 38. Route 39 and Olivine City are to the south.":"38号道路。南边是39号道路和浅葱市。","Route 39. Olivine City is to the south.":"39号道路。南边是浅葱市。","Moomoo Farm. Enjoy our fresh Moomoo Milk!":"哞哞牧场。欢迎品尝新鲜的哞哞鲜奶！","These mountains are my training ground. Every rock here knows my name!":"这片山就是我的训练场。这里的每块石头都认识我！","Rocks do not lie. You are strong.":"石头不会说谎。你很强。","Going down is easy. Coming back up those ledges is another story.":"下山容易。想从那些台阶爬回去可就难了。","Quentin":"昆汀","I camped out here all week, waiting for a real Trainer to come down the mountain!":"我在这里露营了一整个星期，就为了等一个真正的训练家下山！","Worth the wait...":"等得值了……","At night the mountain is so quiet you can hear the Pokémon breathing.":"晚上山里安静得能听见宝可梦的呼吸声。","Kelly":"凯莉","Coming from Blackthorn? Then you beat Clair. I want to see that for myself!":"你是从烟墨市来的？那你打败了小椿。我要亲眼看看！","So it is true...":"原来是真的……","The Pokémon League is next for you, I suppose. I will cheer for you!":"接下来你要去宝可梦联盟了吧。我会为你加油的！","Kenji":"健二","I train by running up and down this road. Hyah! You will be my rest stop!":"我每天沿着这条路跑上跑下来训练。嘿呀！你就是我的休息站！","I need more laps...":"我得再多跑几趟……","My Machoke carries boulders up the mountain. That is our warm-up.":"我的豪力会把石头扛上山。这只是我们的热身。","Michael":"迈克尔","Rock Pokémon are as tough as the mountain. Can you crack them?":"岩石属性的宝可梦和山一样坚硬。你敲得开吗？","Cracked...":"被敲开了……","Golem sheds its shell once a year. The old shells make great walls.":"隆隆岩每年蜕一次壳。旧壳拿来当墙再好不过了。","Ryan":"瑞安","Almost at the bottom! One more battle to keep you warm.":"快到山脚了！再来一场对战暖暖身子吧。","Warmed up, all right.":"身子确实暖和了。","Route 46 is just below. From there it is a short walk to New Bark Town.":"下面就是46号道路。从那里走一小段就到若叶镇了。","Bailey":"贝利","Whoa, careful on those ledges! Now that you are down, how about a battle?":"哇，小心那些台阶！既然你下来了，来对战吧？","I took a tumble...":"我摔了一跤……","Dark Cave is somewhere around here. I keep getting lost in it.":"黑暗洞穴就在这附近。我老是在里面迷路。","Erin":"艾琳","I am having a picnic. Battles go great with lunch!":"我在野餐。对战配午餐最棒了！","My lunch went cold...":"我的午餐都凉了……","New Bark Town is just south and east. The wind there smells like the sea.":"若叶镇就在东南边不远。那里的风有大海的味道。","Route 45. A mountain road. Watch your step: the ledges only go down.":"45号道路。山路。注意脚下：台阶只能往下跳。","Route 45. North: Blackthorn City. South: Route 46.":"45号道路。北：烟墨市。南：46号道路。","Route 46. North: Route 45 and Blackthorn City. South: Route 29.":"46号道路。北：45号道路、烟墨市。南：29号道路。","The panel has slid aside. Stone steps lead down into the dark.":"石板已经移到一旁。石阶一路向下，通往黑暗之中。","A stone panel, cut into square pieces that are all out of place. Something is carved on it...":"这是一块石板，被切成了一块块方形的碎片，全都错了位。上面好像刻着什么……","Put the pieces back together?":"要把碎片拼回去吗？","The last piece clicks into place: a carving of {mon}! With a deep rumble, the panel slides aside.":"最后一块碎片咔嗒一声嵌好了：是{mon}的浮雕！随着一阵低沉的轰响，石板移到了一旁。","Something was set in the rock behind it. {player} found {item}!":"后面的岩石里嵌着什么东西。{player}找到了{item}！","Stone steps lead down into the dark.":"石阶一路向下，通往黑暗之中。","Welcome to the Research Center! The last earthquake shook the ruins, and four chambers that had been sealed for ages opened.":"欢迎来到研究所！上次地震摇动了遗迹，四间封闭了不知多少年的石室打开了。","In each one there is a stone panel, cut into pieces that are all out of place. We have tried for weeks, and none of us can put them back together.":"每间石室里都有一块石板，被切成碎片，全都错了位。我们试了好几个星期，谁也没能把它们拼回去。","Maybe a Trainer with fresh eyes could. The nearest chamber is just to the west. Will you try?":"也许换个新眼光的训练家能做到。最近的石室就在西边。你愿意试试吗？","You solved a panel? Then that explains the cries we heard from below! Strange Pokémon shaped like letters have appeared in the inner chamber.":"你解开了一块石板？难怪我们听到下面有叫声！内部大厅里出现了形状像文字的奇怪宝可梦。","We call them Unown. Every one has the shape of a letter. Please record the ones you catch in this.":"我们叫它们未知图腾。每一只都是一个字母的形状。请把你抓到的记在这里面吧。","Each panel seems to set other letters free. Solve them all, and who knows what we will find!":"每块石板好像都会放出不同的字母。全部解开的话，谁知道会发现什么呢！","Panels solved: {n} of 4. They say the door of the Ho-Oh chamber only opens once the other three are whole.":"已解开的石板：{n}／4。听说凤王石室的门，要等另外三块都拼好了才会打开。","All four panels, whole again! Now, can you catch every letter of the Unown? The report keeps count for you.":"四块石板全都拼好了！那么，你能把未知图腾的每个字母都抓到吗？笔记会帮你记着。","All twenty-six letters of the Unown! Thanks to you, we can finally begin to read the walls of the ruins.":"未知图腾的二十六个字母全齐了！多亏了你，我们终于能开始解读遗迹墙上的文字了。","The air of the chamber stirs. Shapes like letters flit across the walls... Pokémon!":"大厅里的空气动了起来。像文字一样的影子在墙上飞来飞去……是宝可梦！","From every corner of the chamber, Unown come gliding out of the stone...":"未知图腾从大厅的每个角落滑出了石壁……","They circle around you, letter after letter, then sink back into the walls one by one.":"它们一个字母接一个字母地围着你打转，然后又一只只沉回了墙里。","For a moment the carvings glow. The four panels are whole again, as they were long ago.":"一瞬间，墙上的浮雕发出了光芒。四块石板又和很久很久以前一样完整了。","Ruins of Alph, just to the south. Ancient stone chambers, and the Research Center.":"阿露福遗迹就在南边。有古老的石室，还有研究所。","A great stone door, carved with a bird of many colours. It will not move.":"一扇巨大的石门，上面刻着一只五彩的鸟。纹丝不动。","A stone slab blocks the stairs. The panel above must still be in pieces.":"一块石板挡住了楼梯。上面那块石板大概还是碎的。","The ruins hum with a strange power. My Pokémon and I came here to feel it. Let me show you what we learned!":"这片遗迹里涌动着一股奇妙的力量。我和我的宝可梦是来感受它的。让你看看我们学到了什么！","The power of the ruins was not with me today.":"今天遗迹的力量没有站在我这边。","Xatu stand still all day, staring at the sun. Some say they can see both the past and the future.":"天然鸟一整天都一动不动地盯着太阳。听说它们能同时看见过去和未来。","I came all this way to see Pokémon shaped like letters! While I wait, look at the ones I already have!":"我大老远跑来，就是为了看形状像文字的宝可梦！等的时候，先看看我已经有的这些吧！","My collection was no match for yours...":"我的收藏比不过你的……","Smeargle paint their marks all over these ruins. I wonder if they learned it from the old carvings.":"图图犬在遗迹到处画上自己的记号。不知道它们是不是跟古老的浮雕学的。","The people who built these ruins left no names, only carvings. We think they lived side by side with Pokémon.":"建造这些遗迹的人没有留下名字，只留下了浮雕。我们认为他们曾和宝可梦一起生活。","Ruins of Alph. Stone chambers built long ago, by no one knows whom. The Research Center is just to the east.":"阿露福遗迹。很久以前建造的石室，没人知道是谁建的。研究所就在东边。","Books about the ruins, full of drawings of strange letters.":"关于遗迹的书，里面画满了奇怪的文字。","Rows of strange letters are carved into the wall, worn smooth by time.":"墙上刻着一排排奇怪的文字，已经被岁月磨得很平滑了。","Letters cover every wall of this chamber. They look a lot like the Pokémon that drift around in here.":"这间大厅的每面墙上都刻满了文字。它们和在这里飘来飘去的宝可梦长得很像。","Oh, and Professor Elm of New Bark Town called. He has news about Pokémon Eggs, and he would like to see you.":"对了，若叶镇的空木博士打来电话。他说有关于宝可梦蛋的消息，想见见你。","...Wait. You are on your way to the Pokémon League too.":"……等等。你也要去宝可梦联盟吧。","Since the Dragon's Den I keep thinking about what that old man said. I still do not get it. So I will find out the only way I know.":"从龙穴回来以后，我一直在想那个老头说的话。我还是不明白。所以我要用我唯一知道的方法弄清楚。","Battle me. Here. Now.":"跟我对战。就在这里。现在。","Hmph. If that is all you have, the Elite Four will eat you alive. Get stronger.":"哼。如果你只有这点本事，四天王会把你生吞活剥的。去变强吧。","...I lost again. But my Pokémon kept fighting for me, every one of them, to the very end.":"……又输了。但我的宝可梦一直在为我战斗，每一只都坚持到了最后。","I only ever told them to win. I never once asked what they wanted.":"我只会命令它们赢。从来没问过它们想要什么。","Go on to the League. Next time we meet, I will battle with my Pokémon, not just give them orders.":"去联盟吧。下次见面的时候，我会和我的宝可梦一起战斗，而不只是对它们下命令。","The Indigo Plateau! The Pokémon League stands at the top of the road.":"石英高原！宝可梦联盟就矗立在道路的尽头。","With all eight of Johto's badges, the League's challenge for Johto's Trainers is open to you.":"集齐了城都的八枚徽章，联盟为城都训练家准备的挑战向你敞开了。","Falkner of the Violet Gym trained here too. Go and see him. He is waiting for a worthy challenger.":"桔梗道馆的阿速也在这里修行过。去找他吧，他在等一位够格的挑战者。","There are Gyms in cities and towns all over Johto. Keep going, and your strongest Pokémon will listen to you again.":"城都各地的城镇都有道馆。继续前进吧，你最强的宝可梦会重新听你的话。","You have passed my test. Take this. It grows stronger the more your Pokémon trusts you.":"你通过了我的考验。收下这个吧。宝可梦越信任你，它的威力就越强。","Yo, Champion of Kanto! Welcome to Johto's first Gym. Falkner uses Flying-type Pokémon.":"哟，关都的冠军！欢迎来到城都的第一个道馆。阿速用的是飞行属性的宝可梦。","Electric, Ice and Rock moves will bring them down. And remember: here, Pokémon above level 20 might not listen until you win this badge.":"电、冰和岩石属性的招式能把它们打下来。还有，记住：在这里，等级超过20的宝可梦在你拿到这枚徽章之前可能不听话。","Here, take the Zephyr Badge. It is proof that you beat me.":"给，这是飞翼徽章。这是你打败我的证明。","{player} received the Zephyr Badge from Falkner!":"{player}从阿速那里得到了飞翼徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 25 will obey you, even ones raised far away.":"有了它，25级以下的宝可梦都会听你的，就算是在远方培养的也一样。","And this: TM40, Aerial Ace. A move that never misses, like a bird diving on its prey.":"还有这个：招式学习器40，燕返。就像扑向猎物的鸟一样，绝对不会落空的招式。","Sprout Tower was built around a great swaying pillar. It is said to come from a Bellsprout a hundred feet tall!":"喇叭芽之塔是围着一根摇晃的大柱子建起来的。据说那根柱子来自一只三十米高的喇叭芽！","Falkner uses bird Pokémon. Electric and Rock moves hit them hard. Do you have any?":"阿速用的是鸟宝可梦。电属性和岩石属性的招式对它们很有效。你有吗？","My strong Pokémon from Kanto just would not listen in Falkner's Gym. I had to win with the ones I raised here!":"我从关都带来的强力宝可梦在阿速的道馆里就是不听话。最后只能靠在这里培养的宝可梦赢下来！","A Super Potion heals twice as much as a Potion. Worth every coin!":"好伤药的效果是伤药的两倍。物有所值！","Welcome to the Pokémon Academy! Lesson one: a Pokémon that trusts you fights harder. Lesson two: walk with your Pokémon!":"欢迎来到宝可梦学校！第一课：信任你的宝可梦会战斗得更卖力。第二课：多和你的宝可梦一起走路！","I am learning about the time of day. Some Pokémon only come out at night, and Eevee evolves differently by day and by night!":"我在学习一天中的时间段。有些宝可梦只在晚上出现，伊布在白天和晚上的进化也不一样！","Sprout Tower is a place of training. The Sages upstairs battle with Bellsprout, as flexible as the pillar itself.":"喇叭芽之塔是修行的地方。楼上的和尚们用喇叭芽对战，它们就像那根柱子一样柔韧。","Edmond":"艾德","The pillar sways, and so do my Bellsprout. Can you keep your balance?":"柱子在摇，我的喇叭芽也在摇。你能保持平衡吗？","I lost my balance...":"我失去平衡了……","Bend like the pillar, and nothing will break you.":"像柱子一样柔韧，就没有什么能折断你。","One Bellsprout, trained for many years. Let us battle!":"一只喇叭芽，修行了好多年。来对战吧！","Many years, and still not enough.":"修行了这么多年，还是不够啊。","The Elder is at the top. He tests every Trainer who climbs this tower.":"长老在塔顶。每个登上这座塔的训练家，他都会考验一番。","Troy":"阿特","Few reach the third floor. Show me why you did!":"很少有人能来到三楼。让我看看你凭什么！","Now I see why.":"现在我明白了。","The Elder is waiting. Go, and be humble.":"长老在等你。去吧，保持谦逊。","Neal":"阿尼","My Bellsprout and I have trained here since dawn!":"我和我的喇叭芽从天亮就在这里修行了！","And we will train here until dusk.":"我们还要在这里修行到天黑。","Hoothoot only stay awake at night. The Elder raised his own at midnight.":"咕咕只在晚上醒着。长老的咕咕就是在半夜养大的。","I am Li, the Elder of this tower. The Champion of Kanto, here? Then show me the bond you share with your Pokémon.":"我是这座塔的长老。关都的冠军来了吗？那就让我看看你和宝可梦之间的羁绊吧。","Ah... your Pokémon trust you. That is the true strength.":"啊……你的宝可梦信任你。这才是真正的力量。","Elder Li":"长老","Wings need guts! We train from dawn to dusk to master bird Pokémon. Here I come!":"翅膀要靠胆量！我们从早练到晚，就是为了驾驭鸟宝可梦。上了！","Aaaargh!":"啊啊啊——！","Falkner is not just strong. He is a true master of bird Pokémon.":"阿速不只是强而已。他是真正的鸟宝可梦大师。","Abe":"阿贝","You want to face Falkner? Get past me first!":"想挑战阿速？先过我这一关！","Beaten, just like that?":"就这样输了？","You have what it takes. Falkner is right ahead.":"你有这个实力。阿速就在前面。","I am Falkner, Leader of the Violet City Gym! Some say one jolt of electricity is enough to ground a bird. My father's birds and I will prove them wrong!":"我是桔梗市道馆的馆主阿速！有人说只要一记电击就能把鸟打下来。我和父亲的鸟宝可梦会证明他们错了！","...You win. My birds and I still have much to learn.":"……你赢了。我和我的鸟宝可梦还有很多要学的。","Violet City. An old town of quiet scents, with Sprout Tower at its heart.":"桔梗市。飘着淡淡清香的古老城市，喇叭芽之塔就在它的中心。","Violet City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Falkner, who soars with Flying-type Pokémon!":"桔梗市宝可梦道馆。馆主：阿速，与飞行属性宝可梦一同翱翔！","The great pillar sways gently, but it never falls. They say it is the trunk of a giant Bellsprout.":"大柱子轻轻摇晃着，却从来不会倒下。据说那是一只巨大喇叭芽的身体。","West of the city, a strange tree blocks the road north on Route 36. It wiggles when nobody is looking! South of here, Route 32 leads to Union Cave.":"城市西边的36号道路上，有一棵奇怪的树挡住了往北的路。没人看的时候它还会扭来扭去！往南走，32号道路通往互连洞。","Old Sailor":"老水手","Fifty years I sailed around the Whirl Islands. My Pokémon and I learned how to calm their whirlpools.":"我在漩涡列岛一带航行了五十年。我和我的宝可梦学会了怎么让那里的漩涡平静下来。","Shall I teach Whirlpool to one of your Pokémon?":"要我教你的宝可梦潮旋吗？","With the Glacier Badge, Whirlpool calms the whirlpools out at sea. Mind the currents!":"有了冰雪徽章，潮旋就能让海上的漩涡平静下来。小心海流啊！","The still water of the chamber begins to stir, although there is no wind...":"明明没有风，洞室里平静的水面却开始波动……","The Silver Wing glows. A great silver Pokémon raises its head from the water!":"银色之羽发出了光芒。一只巨大的银色宝可梦从水中抬起了头！","Lugia is still there, watching you in silence.":"洛奇亚还在那里，静静地注视着你。","The chamber falls silent. Far above, the whirlpools around the islands grow calm for a moment.":"洞室安静了下来。在遥远的上方，群岛周围的漩涡也平息了片刻。","A cold current pours up out of the hole below. Something down there does not want visitors.":"下方的洞口涌上一股冰冷的水流。下面似乎有什么东西不想被人打扰。","Hail":"冰雹","You did it.":"你做到了。","The big one got away.":"大的那条跑了。","Joe":"乔","Worth the wait.":"没白等。","Megan":"梅根","Your party was full, so {mon} went to your PC.":"你的队伍满了，所以{mon}被送到了电脑里。"},"zh-Hans",""]);
